# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> (pumping function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "pumping function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "A pump is an assembly that bears the designed function of adding mechanical energy to fluid for pressurization and transport."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> (pumping process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> "pumping process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> (pump)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> "pump"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> "A pump is an assembly that bears the designed function of adding mechanical energy to fluid for pressurization and transport."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> "Uma bomba é um conjunto que possui a função projetada de adicionar energia mecânica ao fluido para pressurização e transporte."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> "Every pump is an assembly that has the function of pumping fluid"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> "∀x (Pump(x) ↔ (Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f (PumpingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PUMP> is a <FunctionalObject> that is capable of <PUMPING> but may require parts and subsystems for that capability; including those turns it into a <PUMP SYSTEM>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that adds or removes mechanical energy to a fluid, either constantly or periodically."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> "[DEXPI] A machine that is capable of pumping but may require parts and subsystems for that capability."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> "[POSC Caesar] IMF purpose entity"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000366>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionFunction> (compression function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionFunction> "compression function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionFunction> "A compressor is an assembly that bears the designed function of compressing gases by adding mechanical energy to increase their pressure."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionProcess> (compression process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionProcess> "compression process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> (compressor)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "compressor"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "A compressor is an assembly that bears the designed function of compressing gases by adding mechanical energy to increase their pressure."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "Um compressor é um conjunto que possui a função projetada de comprimir gases através da adição de energia mecânica para aumentar sua pressão."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "Every compressor is an assembly that bears a compression function and has component parts including a compressor casing, compression element, gas inlet, and gas outlet."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "∀x (Compressor(x) ↔ Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f(CompressionFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "[ISO 15926-4] A <COMPRESSOR> is a <FunctionalObject> that has the capability of <COMPRESSING> a <GAS>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is driven by a prime mover by which energy is either constantly or periodically added to an amount of gas in order to increase its pressure."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "[DEXPI] A machine that has the capability of compressing a gas."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "[SLB Glossary] A device that raises the pressure of air or natural gas."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "[OnePetro] A type of pump that increases the pressure of gas. Commonly used as a production rate increaser by increasing the gas pressure delivered from low pressure gas wells to enter the pipe line. The intake into the compressor lowers the wellhead pressure creating a larger drawdown."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> "[POSC Caesar] A 'gas pressure increase device' and an 'artefact' that is driven by a prime mover by which energy is either constantly or periodically added to an amount of gas in order to increase its pressure."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CompressionFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000366>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> (heat transfer function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> "heat transfer function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> "A shell and tube heat exchanger is a heat exchanger that has a tube bundle spatially contained within a surrounding shell."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> (heat transfer process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> "heat transfer process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> (shell and tube heat exchanger)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "shell and tube heat exchanger"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "A shell and tube heat exchanger is a heat exchanger that has a tube bundle spatially contained within a surrounding shell."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "Um trocador de calor de casco e tubos é um trocador de calor que possui um feixe de tubos contido espacialmente dentro de um casco envolvente."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "Every shell and tube heat exchanger is a heat exchanger that has a tube bundle as component part and has a shell as component part, where the tube bundle is spatially contained within the shell."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "ShellAndTubeHeatExchanger(x) → HeatExchanger(x) ∧ ∃tb(TubeBundle(tb) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,tb)) ∧ ∃s(Shell(s) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,s) ∧ spatiallyContains(s,tb))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "Using necessary conditions for this constructive type to avoid false positives under OWA. Any equipment with a shell and tube bundle could theoretically be classified as a standard shell-and-tube heat exchanger, but specialized variants (like graphite shell-and-tube or custom multi-stream designs) should not be automatically forced into this maintenance category without domain expert validation."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "[ISO 15926-4] A <SHELL AND TUBE HEAT EXCHANGER> is a <TUBULAR HEAT EXCHANGER> in which a tube bundle is surrounded by a shell"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "[CFIHOS] A tubular heat exchanger in which a tube bundle is surrounded by a shell."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> "[POSC Caesar] A tubular heat exchanger in which a tube bundle is surrounded by a shell."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000092>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000374>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000732>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000074> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000139>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasAbsorptionFunction> (gas absorption function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasAbsorptionFunction> "gas absorption function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasAbsorptionFunction> "An absorber is a pressure vessel that realizes an absorption function for selective mass transfer of components from a fluid mixture into an absorbent phase."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasAbsorptionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasAbsorptionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorptionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasAbsorptionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorptionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorptionProcess> (absorption process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorptionProcess> "absorption process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorptionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorptionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidMixture>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorptionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorbentPhase>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorptionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DepletedFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AbsorptionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RichAbsorbent>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> (absorber)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> "absorber"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> "An absorber is a pressure vessel that realizes an absorption function for selective mass transfer of components from a fluid mixture into an absorbent phase."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> "Um absorvedor é um vaso de pressão que realiza uma função de absorção para transferência seletiva de massa de componentes de uma mistura fluida para uma fase absorvente."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> "Every absorber is a pressure vessel that has a gas-absorption function whose realization absorbs specific components from a fluid mixture through mass transfer to an absorbent phase"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> "∀x(Absorber(x) ↔ (PressureVessel(x) ∧ ∃f(GasAbsorptionFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> "[ISO 15926-4] An <ABSORBER> is a <FunctionalObject> that has a capability of <ABSORBING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> "[OnePetro] A vertical, cylindrical vessel that recovers heavier (longer carbon chain) hydrocarbons from a mixture of lighter hydrocarbons."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> "[POSC Caesar] A functional object that absorbs."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000075> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000090> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasAbsorptionFunction>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingFunction> (temperature sensing function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingFunction> "temperature sensing function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingFunction> "A temperature element is an instrument that bears a temperature sensing function."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingProcess> (temperature sensing process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingProcess> "temperature sensing process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureMeasurementResult>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> (temperature element)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> "temperature element"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> "A temperature element is an instrument that bears a temperature sensing function."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> "Um elemento de temperatura é um instrumento que possui uma função de sensoreamento de temperatura."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> "Every temperature element is a detecting element that has the function to sense temperature"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> "∀x(TemperatureElement(x) ↔ DetectingElement(x) ∧ ∃f(TemperatureSensingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> "[CFIHOS] A detecting element intended to sense temperature."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> "[POSC Caesar] A detecting element intended to sense temperature."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000091> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TemperatureSensingFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000142>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000116>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000076> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> (flow control function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> "flow control function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> "A valve is an assembly that bears a flow control function to permit, obstruct, regulate, or divert fluid streams."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> (flow control process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> "flow control process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControl>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControl>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControl> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> (valve)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "valve"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "A valve is an assembly that bears a flow control function to permit, obstruct, regulate, or divert fluid streams."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "Uma válvula é um conjunto que possui uma função de controle de fluxo para permitir, obstruir, regular ou desviar correntes de fluido."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "Every valve is a material artifact that has the function to control fluid flow by permitting, obstructing, regulating, or diverting fluid streams."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "∀x(Valve(x) ↔ MaterialArtifact(x) ∧ ∃f(FlowControlFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "Might be too restrictive to define as sufficient being a material artifact and having a flow control function."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "[ISO 15926-4] A <VALVE> is a <FLUID REGULATOR> that can be used to control (i.e. permit, obstruct, regulate or divert) a fluid stream"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "[CFIHOS] A fluid regulator that can be used to control (i.e. permit, obstruct, regulate or divert) a fluid stream."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "[OnePetro] Any of several valves:  plug, gate, butterfly, needle, etc., used in oil field operations."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> "[POSC Caesar] A fluid regulator that can be used to control (i.e. permit, obstruct, regulate or divert) a fluid stream."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000366>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> (containment function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> "containment function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> "A ValveComponent that bears a ContainmentFunction and that serves as the main fluid and pressure containing component of a valve, housing and supporting the working components."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess> (containment process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess> "containment process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> (valve body)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> "valve body"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> "A ValveComponent that bears a ContainmentFunction and that serves as the main fluid and pressure containing component of a valve, housing and supporting the working components."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> "Um ValveComponent que porta uma ContainmentFunction e que serve como o principal componente de contenção de fluido e pressão de uma válvula, alojando e suportando os componentes de trabalho."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> "Every valve body is a valve component that contains and supports valve working components and bears the function of fluid and pressure containment."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> "∀x(ValveBody(x) → ValveComponent(x) ∧ ∃f(ContainmentFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)) ∧ ∃y(WorkingComponent(y) ∧ houses(x,y)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> "Constructive type - the structural characteristics of being the main pressure-containing housing component are necessary conditions but may not be sufficient under OWA, as various specialized valve body configurations exist that might contain additional components or have hybrid designs that could lead to false positive classifications."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> "[ISO 15926-4] A <VALVE BODY> is a <VALVE COMPONENT> and a <CONTAINER> that is the main fluid or pressure containing component of a valve, housing and supporting the working components"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000078> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingFunction> (sealing function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingFunction> "sealing function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingFunction> "A MaterialArtifact that has a sealing surface component and participates in valve closing processes, consisting in that part of a valve against which the closure element bears to provide tight shutoff."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingProcess> (sealing process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingProcess> "sealing process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> (seat)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> "seat"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> "A MaterialArtifact that has a sealing surface component and participates in valve closing processes, consisting in that part of a valve against which the closure element bears to provide tight shutoff."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> "Um MaterialArtifact que possui um componente de superfície de vedação e participa em processos de fechamento de válvulas, consistindo na parte da válvula contra a qual o elemento de fechamento se apoia para proporcionar vedação hermética."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> "Every Seat is a MaterialArtifact that has some sealing surface component at all times and participates in some valve closing process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> "∀x(Seat(x) → MaterialArtifact(x) ∧ ∃y(SealingSurface(y) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,y)) ∧ ∃z(ValveClosingProcess(z) ∧ participatesIn(x,z)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> "Constructive type based on physical configuration. Under OWA, sufficient conditions for 'seat' based solely on structural properties could lead to false positives where other valve components with sealing surfaces are incorrectly classified as seats."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> "[SLB Glossary] That part of a valve against which the closure element (gate, ball) affects a tight shutoff."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000080> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SealingFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> (filtration function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> "filtration function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> "A filter is a separator that bears a filtration function to selectively remove unwanted constituents from a fluid stream using a filter element within a filter housing."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> (filtration process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> "filtration process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RemovedMaterial>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> (filter)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "filter"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "A filter is a separator that bears a filtration function to selectively remove unwanted constituents from a fluid stream using a filter element within a filter housing."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "Um filtro é um separador que possui uma função de filtração para remover seletivamente constituintes indesejados de um fluxo de fluido usando um elemento filtrante dentro de um alojamento de filtro."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "Every filter is a separator that has a filtration function and has a filter element as component part and has a filter housing as component part"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "∀x(Filter(x) ↔ (Separator(x) ∧ ∃f(FiltrationFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)) ∧ ∃e(FilterElement(e) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,e)) ∧ ∃h(FilterHousing(h) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,h))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "[ISO 15926-4] A <FILTER> is a  <FunctionalObject> that is capable of <FILTERING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "[CFIHOS] A separator intended to remove solids from vapour or liquid."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "[DEXPI] An apparatus or machine that is capable of filtering (from ``_)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "[SLB Glossary] A process or algorithm using a set of limits used to eliminate unwanted portions of seismic data, commonly on the basis of frequency or amplitude, to enhance the signal-to-noise ratio of the data or to achieve deconvolution."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "[SLB Glossary] Devices for selecting or excluding data from a data stream or dataset."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> "[POSC Caesar] A separator intended to remove solids from vapour or liquid"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000092>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementFunction> (flow measurement function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementFunction> "flow measurement function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementFunction> "A MeasuringElement that bears a FlowMeasurementFunction and that is designed to determine and quantify the rate of fluid flow through a system."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementProcess> (flow measurement process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementProcess> "flow measurement process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementResult>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> (flow measuring element)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> "flow measuring element"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> "A MeasuringElement that bears a FlowMeasurementFunction and that is designed to determine and quantify the rate of fluid flow through a system."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> "Um MeasuringElement que possui uma FlowMeasurementFunction e que é projetado para determinar e quantificar a taxa de fluxo de fluido através de um sistema."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> "Every FlowMeasuringElement is a MeasuringElement that bears a FlowMeasurementFunction"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> "∀x(FlowMeasuringElement(x) ↔ (MeasuringElement(x) ∧ ∃f(FlowMeasurementFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> "[ISO 15926-4] A <FLOW MEASURING ELEMENT> is  a <MEASURING ELEMENT> that is used to measure <FLOW RATE>"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000116>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000082> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowModificationFunction> (flow modification function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowModificationFunction> "flow modification function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowModificationFunction> "A MaterialArtifact that bears a FlowModificationFunction and that is used as a component in flow control assemblies to alter the characteristics of fluid flow such as velocity profile, turbulence, or pressure distribution."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowModificationFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowModificationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowModificationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowModificationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowModificationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowModificationProcess> (flow modification process)

