AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ProcessControlledFlowFunction> "process controlled flow function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ProcessControlledFlowFunction> "A choke control valve is a control valve that has a choke geometry component for pressure reduction through flow restriction."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ProcessControlledFlowFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ProcessControlledFlowFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ProcessControlledFlowProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ProcessControlledFlowFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ProcessControlledFlowProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ProcessControlledFlowProcess> (process controlled flow process)

