# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> (flow control function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> "flow control function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> "A diaphragm valve is a valve that uses a resilient diaphragm forced against a port as its closure mechanism to control fluid flow."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> (flow control process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> "flow control process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControl>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControl>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControl> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> (diaphragm valve)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> "diaphragm valve"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> "A diaphragm valve is a valve that uses a resilient diaphragm forced against a port as its closure mechanism to control fluid flow."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> "Uma válvula de diafragma é uma válvula que usa um diafragma resiliente forçado contra uma porta como seu mecanismo de fechamento para controlar o fluxo de fluido."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> "Every diaphragm valve is a valve that has a resilient diaphragm as component part and has a port as component part and participates in diaphragm closure processes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> "∀x (DiaphragmValve(x) → Valve(x) ∧ ∃d,p (ResilientDiaphragm(d) ∧ Port(p) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,d) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,p)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> "Since this is a constructive type defined by physical mechanism (diaphragm closure), necessary conditions are used to avoid over-classification under the Open World Assumption. Not every equipment with a diaphragm component should automatically be classified as a diaphragm valve - the structural differentia requires domain validation."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DIAPHRAGM VALVE> is a <MEMBRANE VALVE> where the closure member is a resilient diaphragm being forced against a port"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> "[CFIHOS] A membrane valve that is a membrane valve where the closure member is a resilient diaphragm being forced against a port."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowControlFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000329>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000095>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000120>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000100>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000123>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000108> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000140>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementFunction> (differential pressure measurement function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementFunction> "differential pressure measurement function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementFunction> "A differential pressure gauge is a pressure gauge that measures and indicates the difference between two pressure inputs using a differential pressure measuring element."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementProcess> (differential pressure measurement process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementProcess> "differential pressure measurement process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureMeasurementResult>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureMeasurementResult>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000109> (differential pressure gauge)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000109> "differential pressure gauge"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000109> "A differential pressure gauge is a pressure gauge that measures and indicates the difference between two pressure inputs using a differential pressure measuring element."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000109> "Um manômetro de pressão diferencial é um manômetro que mede e indica a diferença entre duas entradas de pressão usando um elemento de medição de pressão diferencial."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000109> "Every differential pressure gauge is a pressure gauge that bears a DifferentialPressureMeasurementFunction and has component parts including a DifferentialPressureMeasuringElement and PressurePortPair."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000109> "∀x (DifferentialPressureGauge(x) ↔ PressureGauge(x) ∧ ∃f(DifferentialPressureMeasurementFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)) ∧ ∃e(DifferentialPressureMeasuringElement(e) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,e)) ∧ ∃p(PressurePortPair(p) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,p)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000109> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DIFFERENTIAL PRESSURE GAUGE> is a <PRESSURE GAUGE> and a <DIFFERENTIAL PRESSURE MEASURING INSTRUMENT> using a <DIFFERENTIAL PRESSURE MEASURING ELEMENT>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000109> "[CFIHOS] A gauge that is intended for measuring and indicating pressure differences."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000109> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000143> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementFunction>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000251>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureTransmissionFunction> (differential pressure transmission function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureTransmissionFunction> "differential pressure transmission function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureTransmissionFunction> "A differential pressure transmitter is a pressure transmitter that bears a differential pressure transmission function, enabling it to measure the pressure difference between two input pressure signals and transmit this difference as a standardized output signal."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureTransmissionFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureTransmissionFunction>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureTransmissionFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DifferentialPressureMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess> (differential pressure measurement and transmission process)

