SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EmergencyShutDownProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EmergencyShutDownProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EmergencyShutDownProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000114> (emergency shut down valve)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000114> "emergency shut down valve"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000114> "An emergency shut down valve is a valve that bears an emergency shut down function, enabling rapid flow isolation in emergency situations through actuated mechanisms with fail-safe capability."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000114> "Uma válvula de parada de emergência é uma válvula que possui uma função de parada de emergência, permitindo o isolamento rápido de fluxo em situações de emergência através de mecanismos atuados com capacidade à prova de falhas."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000114> "Every emergency shut down valve is a valve that has an emergency shut down function and has an actuator and has a fail-safe system."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000114> "∀x (EmergencyShutDownValve(x) ↔ (Valve(x) ∧ ∃f(EmergencyShutDownFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000114> "[ISO 15926-4] An <EMERGENCY SHUT DOWN VALVE> is an <ACTUATED VALVE> that is assigned to act in case of emergency"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000114> "[CFIHOS] A valve that is assigned to act in case of emergency."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000114> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EmergencyShutDownFunction>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementFunction> (gas movement function)

