AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementFunction> "A fan is an assembly that bears a gas movement function for delivering or exhausting volumes of vapor or gas at low differential pressure."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementProcess>))

