SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> (fan)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> "fan"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> "A fan is an assembly that bears a gas movement function for delivering or exhausting volumes of vapor or gas at low differential pressure."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> "Um ventilador é um conjunto que possui uma função de movimentação de gás para fornecer ou exaurir volumes de vapor ou gás com baixa pressão diferencial."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> "Every fan is an assembly that bears a gas movement function, and every assembly that bears a gas movement function is a fan."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> "∀x(Fan(x) ↔ (Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f(GasMovementFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> "[ISO 15926-4] A <FAN> is a <FunctionalObject> that is capable of <DELIVERING> or <EXHAUSTING> volumes of vapour or gas at low differential pressure"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is intended to deliver or exhaust volumes of vapour or gas at low differential pressure."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> "[POSC Caesar] An 'artefact' and a 'gas pressure increase device' that is intended to deliver or exhaust volumes of vapour or gas at low differential pressure."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/GasMovementFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000115> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementFunction> (flow measurement function)

