AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowMeasurementFunction> "A flow element is an instrument that has the function to measure flow rates in a flowstream and produce signals proportional to the measured flow."@en)
