AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowIndicationFunction> "A flow indicator is an indicator that is designed to indicate flow rates using a flow element and display element."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowIndicationFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/IndicationFunction>)
