SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowIndicationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowIndicationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowIndicationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowIndicationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlowIndicationProcess> (flow indication process)

