AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelDetectionFunction> "A level element is an instrument that bears a level detection function for determining fluid level in a vessel or container."@en)
