SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelDetectionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelMeasurementResult>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128> (level element)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128> "level element"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128> "A level element is an instrument that bears a level detection function for determining fluid level in a vessel or container."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128> "Um elemento de nível é um instrumento que possui uma função de detecção de nível para determinar o nível de fluido em um vaso ou recipiente."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128> "Every level element is a detector that has the function to detect fluid level"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128> "∀x (LevelElement(x) ↔ Detector(x) ∧ ∃f(LevelDetectionFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128> "[CFIHOS] A detecting element that is intended to determine a level."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000091> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelDetectionFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000128> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000144>)
