AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelIndicationFunction> "A level indicator is an indicator that measures and locally displays the level of liquid or bulk solid material in a vessel or tank."@en)
