# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> (level indicator)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> "level indicator"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> "A level indicator is an indicator that measures and locally displays the level of liquid or bulk solid material in a vessel or tank."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> "Um indicador de nível é um indicador que mede e exibe localmente o nível de material líquido ou sólido a granel em um vaso ou tanque."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> "Every level indicator is an indicator that has the function to measure and locally indicate level."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> "∀x (LevelIndicator(x) ↔ (Indicator(x) ∧ ∃f (LevelIndicationFunction(f) ∧ hasFunction(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> "[ISA 5.1] A level indicator (LI) is an instrument that measures and locally displays the level of liquid or bulk solid material in a vessel or tank. It consists of a level sensing element (float, displacer, sight glass, or electronic sensor) and a local display. Unlike a level transmitter, it does not produce a standardized remote output signal; its function is limited to local indication for operator reading at the instrument location."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000127> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelIndicationFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000131>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000154>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000129> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000143>)

