AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelIndicationFunction> "A level sight glass is a sight glass that bears a designed function to indicate liquid level through visual inspection."@en)
