SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelIndicationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelIndicationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfLiquid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelIndicationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/VisualIndication>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000130> (level sight glass)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000130> "level sight glass"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000130> "A level sight glass is a sight glass that bears a designed function to indicate liquid level through visual inspection."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000130> "Um visor de nível é um visor que possui uma função projetada para indicar o nível de líquido através de inspeção visual."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000130> "Every level sight glass is a sight glass that has the function of level indication."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000130> "∀x (LevelSightGlass(x) ↔ SightGlass(x) ∧ ∃f (LevelIndicationFunction(f) ∧ hasFunction(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000130> "[ISO 15926-4] A <LEVEL SIGHT GLASS> is an <INSTRUMENTATION ITEM> and a <SIGHT GLASS> mounted in or on a pipe or vessel to see inside for liquid level inspection"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000130> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000085> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelIndicationFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000130> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000278>)
