# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelMeasurementAndTransmissionFunction> (level measurement and transmission function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelMeasurementAndTransmissionFunction> "level measurement and transmission function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelMeasurementAndTransmissionFunction> "A level transmitter is a transmitter that measures the level (height) of liquid or bulk solid material in a container and produces a standardized electrical output signal proportional to the measured level."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelMeasurementAndTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelMeasurementAndTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelMeasurementAndTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LevelMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess>))

