SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureSignalTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureSignalTransmissionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureSignalTransmissionProcess> (pressure signal transmission process)

