AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> "containment function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> "A vessel is an assembly designed to contain fluids or solids for storage and/or processing purposes."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess> (containment process)

