SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectrochemicalOxidationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectrochemicalOxidationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RemovedMaterial>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000212> (anode)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000212> "anode"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000212> "An anode is electrical equipment that bears the function of serving as the positive electrode in electrochemical processes, capable of emitting positive charge carriers to and/or receiving negative charge carriers from a medium of lower conductivity."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000212> "Um ânodo é um equipamento elétrico que possui a função de servir como eletrodo positivo em processos eletroquímicos, capaz de emitir portadores de carga positiva para e/ou receber portadores de carga negativa de um meio de menor condutividade."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000212> "[ISO 15926-4] An <ANODE> is an <ELECTRICAL DEVICE> that has a capability of <EMITTING> positive charge carriers to, and/or <RECEIVING> negative charge carriers from, the medium of lower conductivity"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000212> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is capable of emitting positive charge carriers to and/or receiving negative charge carriers from the medium of lower conductivity."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000212> "[SLB Glossary] The half of a battery that is positively charged and to which anions migrate by electrostatic attraction."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000212> "[OnePetro] The positively charged site in a cell. Oxidation site. The site of metal loss in corrosion."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000212> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AnodeFunction>)))

