AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementTransmissionFunction> "axial displacement transmission function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementTransmissionFunction> "An axial displacement transmitter is a transmitter that measures axial displacement and generates a standardized output signal representing the measured axial displacement."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementTransmissionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementTransmissionProcess> (axial displacement transmission process)

