# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000213> (axial displacement transmitter)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000213> "axial displacement transmitter"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000213> "An axial displacement transmitter is a transmitter that measures axial displacement and generates a standardized output signal representing the measured axial displacement."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000213> "Um transmissor de deslocamento axial é um transmissor que mede deslocamento axial e gera um sinal de saída padronizado representando o deslocamento axial medido."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000213> "[ISO 15926-4] An <AXIAL DISPLACEMENT TRANSMITTER> is a <DISPLACEMENT TRANSMITTER> for <AXIAL DISPLACEMENT> measurement, using an <AXIAL DISPLACEMENT MEASURING PROBE>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000213> "[CFIHOS] A transmitter measuring an axial displacement and generating a standardized output signal representing the axial measured displacement."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000213> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000157> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementTransmissionFunction>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementMeasuringProbe>)))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementMeasuringProbe> "axial displacement measuring probe"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/AxialDisplacementMeasuringProbe> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
