DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000213> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000155>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000213> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000118>)
