# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/StorageFunction> (storage function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/StorageFunction> "storage function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/StorageFunction> "A basin is a vessel that is designed to store liquid or solid material, characterized by being typically open at the top and installed partly or totally below grade."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/StorageFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/StorageFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/StorageProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/StorageFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/StorageProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/StorageProcess> (storage process)

