AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BoilingFunction> "A boiler is a heater that brings a liquid to its boiling point through indirect contact heat exchange, producing steam or vapor."@en)
