# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> (boiler)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> "boiler"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> "A boiler is a heater that brings a liquid to its boiling point through indirect contact heat exchange, producing steam or vapor."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> "Uma caldeira é um aquecedor que leva um líquido ao seu ponto de ebulição através de troca de calor por contato indireto, produzindo vapor."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> "Every boiler is a heater that bears a BoilingFunction and has component parts including a steam drum and heat exchange surface."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> "∀x (Boiler(x) ↔ Heater(x) ∧ ∃f(BoilingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> "[ISO 15926-4] A <BOILER> is a <HEATER> that brings a <LIQUID> to its boiling point"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> "[CFIHOS] An indirect contact heat exchanger that is intended to heat a liquid."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> "[DEXPI] A that brings a liquid to its boiling point."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000217> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000124> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BoilingFunction>)))
