# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BottomHoleDrillingFunction> (bottom hole drilling function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BottomHoleDrillingFunction> "bottom hole drilling function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BottomHoleDrillingFunction> "A bottom hole assembly is a drilling component that performs specialized drilling operations at the bottom of the drill string, characterized by including a drill bit and being positioned at the bottom hole location."@en)
