SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BottomHoleDrillingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/LoggingData>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000218> (bottom hole assembly)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000218> "bottom hole assembly"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000218> "A bottom hole assembly is a drilling component that performs specialized drilling operations at the bottom of the drill string, characterized by including a drill bit and being positioned at the bottom hole location."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000218> "Um conjunto de fundo de poço é um componente de perfuração que realiza operações especializadas de perfuração na parte inferior da coluna de perfuração, caracterizado por incluir uma broca e estar posicionado no local do fundo do poço."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000218> "[ISO 15926-4] A <BOTTOM HOLE ASSEMBLY> is a <DRILLING COMPONENT> that is the lower part of a drill string, extending from the bit to the drill pipe."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000218> "[OnePetro] The equipment or tools at the bottom of the tubing or drill string. The BHA is changed to achieve a certain result."@en)
