# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingFunction> (braking function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingFunction> "braking function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingFunction> "A brake is an assembly that bears a braking function to arrest or prevent the motion of an object, typically through friction or electromagnetic force application."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingProcess> (braking process)

