SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MovingObject>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RestrictedObject>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> (brake)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> "brake"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> "A brake is an assembly that bears a braking function to arrest or prevent the motion of an object, typically through friction or electromagnetic force application."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> "Um freio é um conjunto que possui uma função de frenagem para deter ou prevenir o movimento de um objeto, tipicamente através da aplicação de força de atrito ou eletromagnética."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> "Every brake is an assembly that has the function of braking, and every assembly that has the function of braking is a brake."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> "∀x(Brake(x) ↔ (Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f(BrakingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> "[ISO 15926-4] A <BRAKE> is a <FunctionalObject> that has the capability of <BRAKING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> "[CFIHOS] A physical object intended to arrest or prevent the motion of an item. Typically by means of friction."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> "[SLB Glossary] The mechanism on the drawworks that permits the driller to control the speed and motion of the drilling line and the drillstring."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> "[OnePetro] In a drillng context, a brake is the main device for stopping the travel of the drawworks of a rig when running or pulling a drill string."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000219> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BrakingFunction>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CombustionFunction> (combustion function)

