AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CombustionFunction> "A burner is a heater that releases thermal energy by burning a combustible mixture of fuel and air."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CombustionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CombustionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CombustionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CombustionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CombustionProcess>))

