SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/WellFluidControlProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/WellFluidControlProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FormationFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/WellFluidControlProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FormationFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> (christmas tree)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "christmas tree"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "A christmas tree is an assembly that bears a well fluid control function, is connected to a wellhead, and contains master valves for controlling formation fluids from oil and gas wells."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "Uma árvore de natal é um conjunto que possui uma função de controle de fluidos de poço, está conectada a uma cabeça de poço, e contém válvulas mestras para controlar fluidos de formação de poços de petróleo e gás."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "Every christmas tree is an assembly that has the function to control well fluids and is connected to a wellhead and has master valves as component parts."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "∀x (ChristmasTree(x) ↔ (Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f(WellFluidControlFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)) ∧ ∃w(Wellhead(w) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,w)) ∧ ∃v(MasterValve(v) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,v))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "[ISO 15926-4] A <CHRISTMAS TREE> is a <PIPING SYSTEM> that is an assembly of pipes and piping parts, with valves and associated control equipment that is connected to the top of a wellhead and is intended for control of fluid from a well."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is an assembly of pipes and piping parts, with valves and associated control equipment that is connected to the top of a wellhead and is intended for control of fluid from a well."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "[SLB Glossary] The set of valves, spools, and fittings connected to the top of a well to direct and control the flow of formation fluids from the well."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "[OnePetro] The control sections that sits above the basic wellhead. It may contain hangers, master valves, annular valves, wing valves, and gauges or pressure, flow rate or monitoring measurement equipment."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> "[POSC Caesar] An 'artefact' that is an assembly of pipes and piping parts, with valves and associated control equipment that is connected to the top of a wellhead and is intended for control of fluid from a well."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/WellFluidControlFunction>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000728>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000734>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000092>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000228> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073>)

