AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ChromatographicAnalysisFunction> "A chromatograph is a process analyzer that bears a chromatographic analysis function."@en)
