AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MovementCompensationFunction> "A compensator is a material artifact that has the designed function of compensating for axial or radial movement between two connected elements."@en)
