AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000230> "A compensator is a material artifact that has the designed function of compensating for axial or radial movement between two connected elements."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000230> "Um compensador é um artefato material que tem a função projetada de compensar movimento axial ou radial entre dois elementos conectados."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000230> "[ISO 15926-4] A <COMPENSATOR> is a <FunctionalObject> that has a capability of <COMPENSATING> for axial or radial movement between two elements that is connected"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000230> "[CFIHOS] A device compensating for axial or radial movement between two elements that is connected."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000230> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MovementCompensationFunction>)))

