SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CondensationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))
