# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000232> (condenser)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000232> "condenser"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000232> "A condenser is a heat exchanger that bears a designed function to condense vapor to liquid by removing latent heat of vaporization."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000232> "Um condensador é um trocador de calor que possui uma função projetada para condensar vapor em líquido removendo o calor latente de vaporização."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000232> "Every condenser is a heat exchanger that bears a condensation function, and every heat exchanger that bears a condensation function is a condenser."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000232> "∀x (Condenser(x) ↔ (HeatExchanger(x) ∧ ∃f(CondensationFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000232> "[ISO 15926-4] A <CONDENSER> is a <COOLER> that has a capability of  <CONDENSING> a <FLUID> from <VAPOUR> to <LIQUID>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000232> "[CFIHOS] A cooler that is intended to change a vapour to liquid."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000232> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000092> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CondensationFunction>)))

