# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlFunction> (control function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlFunction> "control function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlFunction> "A controller is an instrument that bears a control function, automatically regulating a controlled variable by measuring it, comparing with a reference value, and generating output signals to reduce deviation."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlProcess> (control process)

