# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CoolingFunction> (cooling function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CoolingFunction> "cooling function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CoolingFunction> "A cooling tower is a heat exchanger that incorporates a tall tower structure through which air circulates by convection to remove heat from process fluids."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CoolingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CoolingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CoolingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CoolingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/CoolingProcess>))

