SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DampingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000239> (damper)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000239> "damper"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000239> "A damper is an assembly that bears the designed function to suppress, regulate, or reduce unfavorable dynamic characteristics such as vibrations, pressure fluctuations, or flow disturbances."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000239> "Um amortecedor é um conjunto que possui a função projetada de suprimir, regular ou reduzir características dinâmicas desfavoráveis como vibrações, flutuações de pressão ou distúrbios de fluxo."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000239> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DAMPER> is a <FunctionalObject> that has the capability of <DAMPING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000239> "[CFIHOS] A device that damps, typically a valve or plate (as in the flue of a furnace) for regulating the draft, or a device to stop vibration, typically a shock absorber or snubber."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000239> "[POSC Caesar] A device for suppressing unfavourable characteristics or behavior."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000239> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DampingFunction>)))

