AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DeaerationFunction> "A deaerator is a separator designed to remove dissolved gases from liquid streams through specialized degassing processes."@en)
