# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> (deaerator)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> "deaerator"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> "A deaerator is a separator designed to remove dissolved gases from liquid streams through specialized degassing processes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> "Um desaerador é um separador projetado para remover gases dissolvidos de correntes líquidas através de processos especializados de desgaseificação."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> "Every deaerator is a separator that bears a deaeration function for removing dissolved gases from liquids"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> "∀x(Deaerator(x) ↔ (Separator(x) ∧ ∃f(DeaerationFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DEAERATOR> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <SEPARATOR> intended to release dissolved gases from a liquid, typically to release oxygen and carbon dioxide from water"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> "[OnePetro] Devices used to separate gasses from liquids."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DeaerationFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000240> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000225>)

