AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DegassingFunction> "degassing function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DegassingFunction> "A degasser is a separator that removes gases from drilling fluids by realizing a degassing function."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DegassingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
