SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DegassingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DegassingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DrillingFluid>))
