# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> (degasser)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> "degasser"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> "A degasser is a separator that removes gases from drilling fluids by realizing a degassing function."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> "Um degaseificador é um separador que remove gases de fluidos de perfuração realizando uma função de degaseificação."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> "Every degasser is a separator that bears a degassing function and has drilling fluid as input and degassed drilling fluid plus separated gases as outputs."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> "∀x (Degasser(x) ↔ (Separator(x) ∧ ∃f (DegassingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DEGASSER> is an <ARTEFACT> and a  <FLASH SEPARATOR> that is a device used in drilling to remove gasses from drilling fluid which could otherwise form bubbles"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> "[CFIHOS] A device that removes air or gases (methane, H2S, CO2 and others) from drilling liquids."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> "[SLB Glossary] A device that removes air or gases (methane, H2S, CO2, and others) from drilling liquids."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> "[OnePetro] Any device that helps remove gas from circulated fluid."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DegassingFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000314>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000241> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000124>)

