SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DehumidificationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfAir>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DehumidificationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfAir>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DehumidificationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfWater>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000242> (dehumidifier)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000242> "dehumidifier"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000242> "A dehumidifier is an assembly that bears the function to remove moisture from air."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000242> "Um desumidificador é um conjunto que possui a função de remover umidade do ar."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000242> "Every dehumidifier is an assembly that has the function to perform dehumidification."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000242> "∀x(Dehumidifier(x) ↔ Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f(DehumidificationFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000242> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DEHUMIDIFIER> is a <FunctionalObject> that is capable of <DEHUMIDIFYING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000242> "[CFIHOS] A piece of equipment specifically designed to remove moisture from air."@en)
