AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000243> "A dehydrator is a separator that bears the designed function of removing water and water vapor from process streams."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000243> "Um desidratador é um separador que possui a função projetada de remover água e vapor de água de correntes de processo."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000243> "Every dehydrator is a separator that has the function of dehydration."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000243> "∀x (Dehydrator(x) ↔ Separator(x) ∧ ∃f (DehydrationFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000243> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DEHYDRATOR> is a <FunctionalObject> that is capable of <DEHYDRATING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000243> "[SLB Glossary] A device used to remove water and water vapors from gas."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000243> "[OnePetro] A treating vessel designed to remove water from a process stream."@en)
