# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000244> (demister)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000244> "demister"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000244> "A demister is a separator that bears a demisting function for removing liquid droplets from gas streams through coalescence mechanisms."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000244> "Um demister é um separador que possui uma função de desmistificação para remover gotículas de líquido de correntes gasosas através de mecanismos de coalescência."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000244> "Every demister is a separator that has the function of demisting gas streams by coalescing and removing entrained liquid droplets."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000244> "∀x(Demister(x) ↔ Separator(x) ∧ ∃f(DemistingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000244> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DEMISTER> is a <FunctionalObject> that is capable of <DEMISTING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000244> "[CFIHOS] A physical object intended to catch fluid droplets."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000244> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DemistingFunction>)))
