AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DetectionFunction> "A detector is an instrument that bears a detection function, enabling it to sense states, substances, or phenomena and produce signals based on the detection."@en)
