# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> (detector)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> "detector"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> "A detector is an instrument that bears a detection function, enabling it to sense states, substances, or phenomena and produce signals based on the detection."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> "Um detector é um instrumento que possui uma função de detecção, permitindo-lhe detectar estados, substâncias ou fenômenos e produzir sinais baseados na detecção."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DETECTOR> is an <INSTRUMENTATION FUNCTION> that has a capability of <DETECTING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is an assembly of a sensing element and necessary ancillary devices making it able of detecting a state, e.g. pressure, temperature, or detect the presence of a selected substance, and produce a signal based on the detection."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> "[SLB Glossary] A sensor or receiver, such as a geophone or hydrophone, gravimeter or magnetometer."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> "[ISA 5.1] a device that is used to detect the presence of something, such as flammable or toxic gases or discrete parts; see also primary element and sensor."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000091> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DetectionFunction>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SensingElement>)))
