# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> (distillation column)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> "distillation column"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> "A distillation column is a separator that bears a distillation function to enable separation of fluid mixtures based on differences in component boiling points through vapor-liquid equilibrium."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> "Uma coluna de destilação é um separador que possui uma função de destilação para permitir a separação de misturas de fluidos baseada nas diferenças dos pontos de ebulição dos componentes através do equilíbrio vapor-líquido."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> "Every distillation column is a separator that has the function to perform distillation processes"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> "∀x (DistillationColumn(x) ↔ (Separator(x) ∧ ∃f (DistillationFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DISTILLATION COLUMN> is  a <DISTILLATION SEPARATOR> and a <PROCESS COLUMN> and a <DISTILLER> intended to enable a distillation process"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> "[CFIHOS] A process column intended to enable a distillation process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> "[POSC Caesar] A process column intended to enable a distillation process"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DistillationFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000255> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000225>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingFunction> (diverting function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingFunction> "diverting function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingFunction> "A diverter is a material artifact that bears a designed function to divert or redirect materials, fluids, or flows from their expected course to alternative paths or destinations."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingProcess> (diverting process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingProcess> "diverting process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> (diverter)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> "diverter"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> "A diverter is a material artifact that bears a designed function to divert or redirect materials, fluids, or flows from their expected course to alternative paths or destinations."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> "Um diverter é um artefato material que possui uma função projetada para desviar ou redirecionar materiais, fluidos ou fluxos de seu curso esperado para caminhos ou destinos alternativos."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> "Every diverter is a material artifact that has the function of diverting materials or flows from expected paths to alternative destinations."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> "∀x(Diverter(x) ↔ MaterialArtifact(x) ∧ ∃f(DivertingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DIVERTER> is a <FunctionalObject> that has a capability of <DIVERTING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> "[CFIHOS] A 'device' that is providing diversion of something from an expected course or direction."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> "[SLB Glossary] A chemical agent or mechanical device used in injection treatments, such as matrix stimulation, to ensure a uniform distribution of treatment fluid across the treatment interval."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> "[OnePetro] In the context of acidizing, a diverter is a material that forces acid to enter another zone by having a higher viscosity or building a filter cake.\n        \n        In the context of a wellhead, a diverter is a device in the flowpath at the wellhead that forces fluid to go down a pipe to a pit or tank."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000256> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DivertingFunction>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> (power transmission function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> "power transmission function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> "A drive shaft is an Assembly that bears a PowerTransmissionFunction and consists in a shaft-based system used to transfer rotational mechanical energy from a prime mover to multiple driven machines."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> (power transmission process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> "power transmission process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257> (drive shaft)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257> "drive shaft"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257> "A drive shaft is an Assembly that bears a PowerTransmissionFunction and consists in a shaft-based system used to transfer rotational mechanical energy from a prime mover to multiple driven machines."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257> "Um eixo de transmissão é um Assembly que possui uma PowerTransmissionFunction e consiste em um sistema baseado em eixo usado para transferir energia mecânica rotacional de um motor primário para múltiplas máquinas acionadas."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257> "Over-reaching equivalence (ODR-022 §17). The definition adds \"consists in a shaft-based system\", a structural condition beyond PowerTransmissionFunction. As equivalent it absorbed gear wheel, input shaft and output shaft, none of which is a drive shaft."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DRIVE SHAFT> is an <ARTEFACT> and an <ENERGY TRANSFERRER> that is a shaft used to transfer rotational power from a prime driver to several individual machines by use of drive belts and pulley wheels"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DryingFunction> (drying function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DryingFunction> "drying function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DryingFunction> "A dryer is an assembly that bears a drying function to remove moisture from materials."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DryingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DryingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DryingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DryingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/DryingProcess>))

