# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> (pumping function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "pumping function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "An eductor is a pump that uses a high-pressure motive fluid jet to create a low-pressure zone that entrains and moves a second fluid via momentum transfer."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> (pumping process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> "pumping process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfLiquid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidMixture>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> (eductor)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "eductor"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "An eductor is a pump that uses a high-pressure motive fluid jet to create a low-pressure zone that entrains and moves a second fluid via momentum transfer."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "Um edutor é uma bomba que usa um jato de fluido motriz de alta pressão para criar uma zona de baixa pressão que arrasta e move um segundo fluido via transferência de momento."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "Every eductor is a pump that has a motive fluid nozzle and Ventura throat as component parts and participates in a jet entrainment process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "∀x(Eductor(x) → Pump(x) ∧ ∃n(MotiveFluidNozzle(n) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,n)) ∧ ∃t(VenturaThroat(t) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,t)) ∧ ∃p(JetEntrainmentProcess(p) ∧ participatesIn(x,p)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "The constructive differentia based on jet entrainment mechanism could potentially apply to hybrid or specialized equipment that incorporates eductor principles but should not be automatically classified as a standard eductor type. Under OWA, necessary conditions protect against false positive classifications."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "[ISO 15926-4] An <EDUCTOR> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <PUMP> that is a form of suction pump; a device using a high pressure jet of water to create partial vacuum at an intake opening to draw liquid from a sump"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "[CFIHOS] A form of suction pump; a device using a high pressure jet of water to create partial vacuum at an intake opening to draw liquid from a sump."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> "[OnePetro] A device that through flow of a power fluid through a nozzle, creates a low pressure area useful for moving fluids."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SuctionPort>))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SuctionPort> "suction port"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SuctionPort> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000102>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000259> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> (actuation function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> "actuation function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> "An electric actuator is an actuator that converts electrical energy to mechanical movement through an electric-to-mechanical converter component and operates via electrical signal input."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> (actuation process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> "actuation process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InformationContentEntity>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> (electric actuator)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> "electric actuator"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> "An electric actuator is an actuator that converts electrical energy to mechanical movement through an electric-to-mechanical converter component and operates via electrical signal input."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> "Um atuador elétrico é um atuador que converte energia elétrica em movimento mecânico através de um componente conversor elétrico-mecânico e opera via entrada de sinal elétrico."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> "Constructive classification based on electrical energy conversion mechanism. Under OWA, asserting equivalence would force any artifact with electrical-to-mechanical conversion into this category, potentially misclassifying specialized hybrid equipment or complex electrical machinery that should not be categorized as standard actuators."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> "[ISO 15926-4] An <ELECTRIC ACTUATOR> is an <INSTRUMENTATION ITEM> and a <CONTROLLED ACTUATOR> and an <ELECTRICAL APPARATUS> and an <ELECTRIC TO MECHANICAL ENERGY CONVERTER> that produces a specified movement when actuated by electrical energy"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> "[CFIHOS] An actuator that produces a specified movement when excited by an electric signal."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> "[POSC Caesar] An actuator that produces a specified movement when excited by an electric signal."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000207>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000298>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationFunction> (electric energy generation function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationFunction> "electric energy generation function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationFunction> "An electric generator is an assembly that bears the function of converting non-electric energy into electric energy"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationProcess> (electric energy generation process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationProcess> "electric energy generation process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> (electric generator)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> "electric generator"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> "An electric generator is an assembly that bears the function of converting non-electric energy into electric energy"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> "Um gerador elétrico é um conjunto que possui a função de converter energia não-elétrica em energia elétrica"@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> "Every electric generator is an assembly that has the function to convert non-electric energy into electric energy"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> "∀x (ElectricGenerator(x) ↔ (Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f(ElectricEnergyGenerationFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> "[ISO 15926-4] An <ELECTRIC GENERATOR> is a <GENERATOR> that transforms non-electric energy into <ELECTRIC ENERGY>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> "[CFIHOS] An energy transducer that transforms non-electric energy into electric energy."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricEnergyGenerationFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000113>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000261> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000086>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionFunction> (electrical conduction function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionFunction> "electrical conduction function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionFunction> "An electrical connection is a MaterialArtifact that bears an ElectricalConductionFunction and that provides a pathway for electrical current to pass from one electrical apparatus to another."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionProcess> (electrical conduction process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionProcess> "electrical conduction process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000262> (electrical connection)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000262> "electrical connection"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000262> "An electrical connection is a MaterialArtifact that bears an ElectricalConductionFunction and that provides a pathway for electrical current to pass from one electrical apparatus to another."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000262> "Uma conexão elétrica é um MaterialArtifact que possui uma ElectricalConductionFunction e que fornece um caminho para a corrente elétrica passar de um aparelho elétrico para outro."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000262> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000262> "Over-reaching equivalence (ODR-022 §17). A connection is the joining of conductors; conducting electricity is necessary for it but not sufficient. As equivalent it absorbed switch contact, which ISO defines as \"one of the conductive parts forming a contact assembly\" — a component, not a connection."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000262> "[ISO 15926-4] An <ELECTRICAL CONNECTION> is a <DirectConnection> for letting pass a <CURRENT> from one <ELECTRICAL APPARATUS> to another"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000262> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000262> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConductionFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionFunction> (electrical connection function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionFunction> "electrical connection function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionFunction> "An electrical connector is an electrical equipment that bears an electrical connection function and that maintains intimate electrical contact between two or more electrical conductor parts to enable continuous current flow."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionFunction>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionProcess> (electrical connection process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionProcess> "electrical connection process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000263> (electrical connector)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000263> "electrical connector"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000263> "An electrical connector is an electrical equipment that bears an electrical connection function and that maintains intimate electrical contact between two or more electrical conductor parts to enable continuous current flow."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000263> "Um conector elétrico é um equipamento elétrico que possui uma função de conexão elétrica e que mantém contato elétrico íntimo entre duas ou mais partes de condutor elétrico para permitir fluxo contínuo de corrente."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000263> "[ISO 15926-4] An <ELECTRICAL CONNECTOR> is an <ARTEFACT> and an <CONNECTOR> for holding two parts of <ELECTRICAL CONDUCTOR> in intimate contact"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000263> "[CFIHOS] A connector for holding two parts of a conductor in intimate contact."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000263> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalConnectionFunction>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationFunction> (mechanical energy generation function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationFunction> "mechanical energy generation function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationFunction> "An engine is a motor that converts chemical fuel energy into mechanical force and motion through combustion processes."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationProcess> (mechanical energy generation process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationProcess> "mechanical energy generation process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FuelPortion>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfAir>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ExhaustGas>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> (engine)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> "engine"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> "An engine is a motor that converts chemical fuel energy into mechanical force and motion through combustion processes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> "Um motor é um motor que converte energia de combustível químico em força mecânica e movimento através de processos de combustão."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> "Every Engine is a Motor that has function MechanicalEnergyGenerationFunction and has input ChemicalFuelPortion and participates in CombustionProcess."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> "∀x (Engine(x) ↔ Motor(x) ∧ ∃f(MechanicalEnergyGenerationFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)) ∧ ∃p(FuelPortion(p) ∧ hasInput(x,p)) ∧ ∃c(CombustionProcess(c) ∧ participatesIn(x,c)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> "[ISO 15926-4] An <ENGINE> is a <MOTOR> and a <MACHINE> that converts energy into mechanical force and motion"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> "[CFIHOS] An internal combustion engine that is an induction compression ignition exhaust engine which ignites a fuel air mixture."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000315>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MechanicalEnergyGenerationFunction>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000113>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000264> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationFunction> (thermal expansion accommodation function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationFunction> "thermal expansion accommodation function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationFunction> "An expansion joint is a material artifact that bears the designed function of accommodating thermal expansion and contraction between connected components through inherent flexibility while maintaining structural integrity."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationProcess> (thermal expansion accommodation process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationProcess> "thermal expansion accommodation process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000265> (expansion joint)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000265> "expansion joint"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000265> "An expansion joint is a material artifact that bears the designed function of accommodating thermal expansion and contraction between connected components through inherent flexibility while maintaining structural integrity."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000265> "Uma junta de expansão é um artefato material que possui a função projetada de acomodar expansão e contração térmica entre componentes conectados através de flexibilidade inerente, mantendo a integridade estrutural."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000265> "[ISO 15926-4] An <EXPANSION JOINT> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <JOINT> that makes allowance for thermal expansion of the parts joined without distortion"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000265> "[CFIHOS] Flexible joint between two pipes to receive expansion from the pipes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000265> "[SLB Glossary] A device or completion component designed to enable relative movement between two fixed assemblies in the event of thermal expansion or contraction."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000265> "[OnePetro] A device in a length of pipe that allows some pipe length expansion or contraction."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000265> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ThermalExpansionAccommodationFunction>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> (filtration function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> "filtration function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> "A filter cartridge is a filter that has a replaceable filter medium in a cartridge form factor designed for insertion into and removal from a filter housing."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> (filtration process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> "filtration process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfSolid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> (filter cartridge)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "filter cartridge"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "A filter cartridge is a filter that has a replaceable filter medium in a cartridge form factor designed for insertion into and removal from a filter housing."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "Um cartucho de filtro é um filtro que possui um meio filtrante substituível em formato de cartucho projetado para inserção e remoção de um alojamento de filtro."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "Every filter cartridge is a filter that has a replaceable filter medium as component part and bears a cartridge geometry property."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "∀x (FilterCartridge(x) → Filter(x) ∧ ∃m (ReplaceableFilterMedium(m) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,m)) ∧ ∃p (CartridgeGeometryProperty(p) ∧ bearerOf(x,p)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "Constructive type where the structural differentia (cartridge geometry and replaceability) is necessary but making it sufficient under OWA could lead to false positives - other equipment containing replaceable filter elements might be incorrectly classified as filter cartridges rather than their proper specialized categories."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "[ISO 15926-4] A <FILTER CARTRIDGE> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <FILTER ELEMENT> intended to collect particles from a stream in a filter or strainer"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "[CFIHOS] A filter element intended to collect particles from a stream in a filter or strainer."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> "[POSC Caesar] A filter element intended to collect particles from a stream in a filter or strainer."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000266> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> (filtration function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> "filtration function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> "A Filter that is made from filter media and that is a component part of a filter assembly."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> (filtration process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> "filtration process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> (filter element)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> "filter element"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> "A Filter that is made from filter media and that is a component part of a filter assembly."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> "Um Filtro que é feito de meio filtrante e que é uma parte componente de um conjunto de filtro."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> "FilterElement SubClassOf Filter and (madeFrom some FilterMedia) and (componentPartOf some FilterAssembly)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> "∀x(FilterElement(x) → Filter(x) ∧ ∃m(FilterMedia(m) ∧ madeFrom(x,m)) ∧ ∃a(FilterAssembly(a) ∧ componentPartOf(x,a)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> "Constructive classification based on material composition (filter media) and mereological relationship (component of assembly). Under OWA, asserting equivalence could lead to unintended classification of any artifact made from filter media as a filter element, including specialized or hybrid components that contain filter media but serve different primary functions."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> "[ISO 15926-4] A <FILTER ELEMENT> is a <FILTER> and that is the part of a filter assembly that is made from filter media"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000267> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> (filtration function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> "filtration function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> "A filter press is a filter that applies mechanical compression force to enhance the separation of substances through a pressurized filtration process."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> (filtration process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> "filtration process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfSolid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> (filter press)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "filter press"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "A filter press is a filter that applies mechanical compression force to enhance the separation of substances through a pressurized filtration process."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "Uma prensa filtrante é um filtro que aplica força de compressão mecânica para melhorar a separação de substâncias através de um processo de filtração pressurizada."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "Every filter press is a filter that has a pressure mechanism as part and participates in mechanical compression processes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "∀x(FilterPress(x) → Filter(x) ∧ ∃p(PressureMechanism(p) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,p)) ∧ ∃proc(MechanicalCompressionProcess(proc) ∧ participatesIn(x,proc)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "Using necessary conditions because this is classified as 'both' functional and constructive. The structural differentia (pressure mechanism and compression process) involves specific mechanical configurations that are harder to make sufficient under Open World Assumption without detailed engineering specifications."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "[ISO 15926-4] A <FILTER PRESS> is a <FILTER> and a <PRESS(machine)> intended to separate substance through compression"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "[SLB Glossary] A pressurized cell, fitted with a filter medium, used for evaluating filtration characteristics of a drilling fluid while it is either static or stirred."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> "[OnePetro] Usually a DE filter."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiltrationFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000725>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000225>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000268> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000301>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> (heat transfer function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> "heat transfer function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> "A finned tube heat exchanger is a heat exchanger that has finned tubes as the primary heat transfer surface enhancement mechanism."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> (heat transfer process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> "heat transfer process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> (finned tube heat exchanger)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "finned tube heat exchanger"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "A finned tube heat exchanger is a heat exchanger that has finned tubes as the primary heat transfer surface enhancement mechanism."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "Um trocador de calor de tubos aletados é um trocador de calor que possui tubos aletados como mecanismo primário de aumento da superfície de transferência de calor."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "Every finned tube heat exchanger is a heat exchanger that has finned tubes as component parts at all times"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "∀x(FinnedTubeHeatExchanger(x) → HeatExchanger(x) ∧ ∃y(FinnedTube(y) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,y)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "Using necessary conditions for this constructive type. While finned tubes are the defining structural feature, making sufficient conditions (equivalence) under Open World Assumption could lead to false positives where any assembly containing finned tubes would be classified as this specific heat exchanger type, including complex multi-function equipment or specialized hybrid systems."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "[ISO 15926-4] A <FINNED TUBE HEAT EXCHANGER> is an <INDIRECT CONTACT HEAT EXCHANGER> that has finned tubes"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "[CFIHOS] A heat exchanger that has finned tubes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> "[POSC Caesar] A heat exchange that has finned tubes."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000092>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatTransferFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000726>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000269> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000139>)

