AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiredHeatingFunction> "A fired heater is a heater that burns fuel (solid, liquid, or gas) to generate heat for transfer to a process fluid medium."@en)
