SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FiredHeatingProcess> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatingProcess>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
