SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlameArrestProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> (flame arrestor)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> "flame arrestor"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> "A flame arrestor is a safety device that bears a flame arrest function to prevent flames from entering a system through an opening."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> "Um arrestador de chama é um dispositivo de segurança que possui uma função de arrestar chama para prevenir que chamas entrem em um sistema através de uma abertura."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> "Every flame arrestor is a safety device that has the function of arresting flames and processes gaseous portions while preventing flame propagation."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> "∀x(FlameArrestor(x) ↔ SafetyDevice(x) ∧ ∃f(FlameArrestFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> "[ISO 15926-4] A <FLAME ARRESTOR> is an <ARTEFACT> and an <ARRESTOR> that is a trap covering an opening, e.g of a ventilation system or a pipe, to prevent flames from entering the system"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> "[CFIHOS] An arrestor which is a trap over an opening, e.g. of a ventilation system or a pipe, to prevent flames from entering the system."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlameArrestFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000271> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000272>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlameDetectionFunction> (flame detection function)

