AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlameDetectionFunction> "A flame detector is a detector that has the function to detect the presence of flames."@en)
