# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000272> (flame detector)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000272> "flame detector"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000272> "A flame detector is a detector that has the function to detect the presence of flames."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000272> "Um detector de chama é um detector que tem a função de detectar a presença de chamas."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000272> "[ISO 15926-4] A <FLAME DETECTOR> is a <DETECTOR> and a <FLAME DETECTING INSTRUMENT> using a <FLAME DETECTING MEASURING ELEMENT> that is designed to detect the presence of a flame"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000272> "[CFIHOS] A detector that is intended to sense a flame."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000272> "[POSC Caesar] A detector that is intended to sense a flame."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000272> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000246> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FlameDetectionFunction>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionFunction> (connection function)

