AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionFunction> "A flange is a material artifact characterized by a projecting flat rim, plate, collar, or rib geometry, designed to provide mechanical connection between components."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ConnectionProcess> (connection process)

