SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/HeatingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ReactiveHeatingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ReactiveHeatingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ReactiveHeatingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ReactiveHeatingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ReactiveHeatingProcess> (reactive heating process)

