AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/KnockOutSeparationFunction> "A knock out drum is a separator designed to separate relatively small quantities of liquid from a vapor stream through gravitational and momentum-based phase separation."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/KnockOutSeparationFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationFunction>)
