AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidDirectionFunction> "A nozzle is a material artifact that has a protruding part with a shaped orifice designed to direct fluid flow into a specific pattern."@en)
