SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000317> (output shaft)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000317> "output shaft"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000317> "A Shaft that participates in mechanical energy output processes, serving as the exit point for mechanical energy transmission from a prime mover to external energy consuming equipment."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000317> "Um Eixo que participa em processos de saída de energia mecânica, servindo como ponto de saída para transmissão de energia mecânica de um motor primário para equipamentos consumidores de energia externos."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000317> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000317> "Constructive type based on positional role within mechanical systems. Under OWA, sufficient conditions would be difficult to specify without risk of misclassifying intermediate shafts or complex multi-shaft arrangements that happen to have output characteristics."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000317> "[ISO 15926-4] An <OUTPUT SHAFT> is a <SHAFT> that is the exit of mechanical energy and driver of an external energy consumer."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000317> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000317> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction>))

