AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingFunction> "A pig launcher is a vessel that bears a pig launching function for inserting pipeline pigs into pipeline systems."@en)
