AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigReceivingFunction> "A pig receiver is a vessel that has the function to receive pipe pigs from a pipeline."@en)
