# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingFunction> (pig launching and receiving function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingFunction> "pig launching and receiving function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingFunction> "A pig trap is an assembly that bears the function of launching and receiving pipe pigs for pipeline maintenance and has both launcher and receiver components."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingProcess> (pig launching and receiving process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingProcess> "pig launching and receiving process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipelinePig>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipelinePig>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> (pig trap)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> "pig trap"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> "A pig trap is an assembly that bears the function of launching and receiving pipe pigs for pipeline maintenance and has both launcher and receiver components."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> "Uma armadilha de pig é um conjunto que possui a função de lançar e receber pigs de tubulação para manutenção de dutos e possui componentes de lançador e receptor."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> "Every pig trap is an assembly that bears a pig launching and receiving function and has component parts that are a pig launcher and a pig receiver."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> "∀x(PigTrap(x) ↔ Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f(PigLaunchingAndReceivingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)) ∧ ∃l(PigLauncher(l) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,l)) ∧ ∃r(PigReceiver(r) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,r)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PIG TRAP> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <TOOL> that is a pipeline maintenance tool, which includes a launcher and receiver, introducing a <PIPE PIG> into the line"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> "[CFIHOS] A facility on a pipeline for inserting and retrieving a scraper or pig."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> "[POSC Caesar] \""@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PigLaunchingAndReceivingFunction>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000318>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000319>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000320> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> (fluid conduction function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "fluid conduction function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "A pipe is a material artifact characterized by tubular geometry and longitudinal extent, designed to conduct liquid, gaseous or finely divided solid materials from one location to another, or to serve structural purposes."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> (fluid conduction process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> "fluid conduction process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> (pipe)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "pipe"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "A pipe is a material artifact characterized by tubular geometry and longitudinal extent, designed to conduct liquid, gaseous or finely divided solid materials from one location to another, or to serve structural purposes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "Um tubo é um artefato material caracterizado por geometria tubular e extensão longitudinal, projetado para conduzir materiais líquidos, gasosos ou sólidos finamente divididos de um local para outro, ou para servir a propósitos estruturais."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "Every pipe is a material artifact that has fluid conduction function and has tubular geometry and has longitudinal extent."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "∀x(Pipe(x) → MaterialArtifact(x) ∧ ∃f(FluidConductionFunction(f) ∧ hasFunction(x,f)) ∧ ∃g(TubularGeometry(g) ∧ hasPhysicalProperty(x,g)) ∧ ∃h(LongitudinalExtent(h) ∧ hasPhysicalProperty(x,h)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "Using necessary conditions because pipe is defined by constructive/geometric properties (tubular geometry, longitudinal extent) rather than purely functional criteria. Under Open World Assumption, asserting sufficient conditions based on geometric properties could lead to unintended classification of complex tubular structures that happen to conduct fluids but should not be categorized as standard pipes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PIPE> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <FLUID CONDUCTOR> that is a long tube or hollow body intended for conduction of liquid, gaseous or finely divided solid materials, or used for structural purposes"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is a long tube or hollow body intended for conduction of liquid, gaseous or finely divided solid materials, or used for structural purposes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "[DEXPI] An elementary piece of piping, i.e., not interrupted by any item."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> "[POSC Caesar] An 'artefact' that is a long tube or hollow body intended for conduction of liquid, gaseous or finely divided solid materials, or used for structural purposes."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000077>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> (fluid conduction function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "fluid conduction function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "A pipe bend is a pipe that has a curved geometry to change piping direction with a non-standard radius."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> (fluid conduction process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> "fluid conduction process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> (pipe bend)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "pipe bend"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "A pipe bend is a pipe that has a curved geometry to change piping direction with a non-standard radius."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "Uma curva de tubo é um tubo que possui geometria curvada para mudar a direção da tubulação com um raio não padrão."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "Every pipe bend is a pipe that has curved geometry and has non-standard bend radius."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "∀x (PipeBend(x) → Pipe(x) ∧ ∃g (CurvedGeometry(g) ∧ hasQuality(x,g)) ∧ ∃r (NonStandardBendRadius(r) ∧ hasQuality(x,r)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "Using necessary conditions for this constructive type. While the curved geometry with non-standard radius is distinctive, making it sufficient under OWA could force classification of complex piping assemblies or custom manifolds containing bent sections into this maintenance category inappropriately."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PIPE BEND> is a <PIPING COMPONENT> that is intended to change piping direction with a non-standard radius"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is used to change piping direction with a non-standard radius."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> "[POSC Caesar] An 'artefact' that is intended to change piping direction with a non-standard radius"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000322> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> (fluid conduction function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "fluid conduction function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "A pipe elbow is a pipe that has curved geometry enabling directional changes in pipe runs between 0 and 135 degrees."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> (fluid conduction process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> "fluid conduction process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> (pipe elbow)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> "pipe elbow"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> "A pipe elbow is a pipe that has curved geometry enabling directional changes in pipe runs between 0 and 135 degrees."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> "Um cotovelo de tubulação é uma tubulação que possui geometria curva permitindo mudanças direcionais em trechos de tubulação entre 0 e 135 graus."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> "Every pipe elbow is a pipe that has curved geometry and enables directional change capacity between 0 and 135 degrees."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> "∀x (PipeElbow(x) → (Pipe(x) ∧ ∃g(CurvedGeometry(g) ∧ hasGeometricProperty(x,g)) ∧ ∃p(DirectionalChangeCapacity(p) ∧ hasProperty(x,p))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> "Using necessary conditions for this constructive type protects against false positives under OWA. Any curved piping component would be forcibly classified as a pipe elbow under equivalent axioms, including specialized equipment like coiled tubing, serpentine heat exchanger tubes, or custom manifold sections that contain curved passages but should not be asserted into the standard pipe elbow maintenance category."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PIPE ELBOW> is a <PIPING COMPONENT> and an <ELBOW> that is intended to make a change in the direction of a pipe run between 0 and 135 degrees"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> "[POSC Caesar] An 'elbow' and an 'artefact' that is intended to make a change in the direction of a pipe run between 0 and 135 degrees."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> (fluid conduction function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "fluid conduction function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "A pipe reducer is a pipe that has different nominal pipe sizes at its two ends, intended to connect pipes or piping components of different sizes."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> (fluid conduction process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> "fluid conduction process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> (pipe reducer)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "pipe reducer"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "A pipe reducer is a pipe that has different nominal pipe sizes at its two ends, intended to connect pipes or piping components of different sizes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "Um redutor de tubulação é um tubo que possui tamanhos nominais diferentes de tubulação em suas duas extremidades, destinado a conectar tubos ou componentes de tubulação de tamanhos diferentes."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "Every pipe reducer is a pipe that has an inlet end and outlet end with different nominal pipe sizes"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "∀x (PipeReducer(x) → Pipe(x) ∧ ∃i,o (InletEnd(i) ∧ OutletEnd(o) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,i) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,o) ∧ DifferentNominalPipeSizes(i,o)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "As a constructive type defined by geometric configuration, sufficient conditions are omitted under the Open World Assumption to prevent false positives. Complex assemblies or custom manifolds containing size transitions should not be automatically classified as standard pipe reducers without explicit assertion."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PIPE REDUCER> is a <PIPING COMPONENT> and a <REDUCER> either concentric or eccentric of different  nominal pipe size at the two ends, intended to connect pipes or piping components of different nominal pipe sizes or non standard sizes"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "[CFIHOS] An 'artefact' that has different nominal pipe size at the two ends, intended to connect pipes or piping components."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> "[POSC Caesar] An 'artefact' that has different nominal pipe size at the two ends, intended to connect pipes or piping components."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000324> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> (fluid conduction function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "fluid conduction function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "A pipe tee is a pipe fitting that has three fluid ports arranged in T-shaped configuration, with one branch port perpendicular to two run ports, designed to realize fluid conduction function through flow division or combination."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> (fluid conduction process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> "fluid conduction process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> (pipe tee)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "pipe tee"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "A pipe tee is a pipe fitting that has three fluid ports arranged in T-shaped configuration, with one branch port perpendicular to two run ports, designed to realize fluid conduction function through flow division or combination."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "Um tê de tubulação é uma conexão de tubulação que possui três portas de fluido dispostas em configuração em formato de T, com uma porta de ramal perpendicular a duas portas de passagem, projetada para realizar função de condução de fluido através de divisão ou combinação de fluxo."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "Every pipe tee is a pipe that has exactly three fluid ports arranged in T-configuration and bears a fluid conduction function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "∀x(PipeTee(x) → Pipe(x) ∧ ∃p1,p2,p3(BranchPort(p1) ∧ RunPort(p2) ∧ RunPort(p3) ∧ hasPartAtAllTimes(x,p1) ∧ hasPartAtAllTimes(x,p2) ∧ hasPartAtAllTimes(x,p3) ∧ perpendicularTo(p1,p2) ∧ perpendicularTo(p1,p3)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "Using necessary conditions for this constructive type. The T-shaped geometric configuration with three specific ports is a structural differentia that is harder to make sufficient under OWA. Custom manifolds or complex fittings might contain T-shaped passages but should not be automatically classified as standard pipe tees without domain expert validation."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PIPE TEE> is a <PIPING COMPONENT> and a <PIPING NETWORK NODE> and three piping ends in T-shape, including a branch at 90 degrees"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that has three piping ends in T-shape, including a branch at 90 degrees."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> "[POSC Caesar] An 'artefact' that has three piping ends in T-shape, including a branch at 90 degrees."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BranchPort>))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BranchPort> "branch port"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/BranchPort> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidPort>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000325> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000323>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportFunction> (fluid transport function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportFunction> "fluid transport function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportFunction> "A pipeline is an engineered system that bears a fluid transport function, consisting of pipes and possibly including pumps, valves, and control devices, designed for conveying liquids, gases, or finely divided solids between locations."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportProcess> (fluid transport process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportProcess> "fluid transport process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> (pipeline)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "pipeline"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "A pipeline is an engineered system that bears a fluid transport function, consisting of pipes and possibly including pumps, valves, and control devices, designed for conveying liquids, gases, or finely divided solids between locations."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "Um pipeline é um sistema engenheirado que possui uma função de transporte de fluidos, consistindo de tubos e possivelmente incluindo bombas, válvulas e dispositivos de controle, projetado para transportar líquidos, gases ou sólidos finamente divididos entre locais."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "Every pipeline is an engineered system that bears a fluid transport function and has pipe as a component part at some time."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "∀x(Pipeline(x) ↔ EngineeredSystem(x) ∧ ∃f(FluidTransportFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PIPELINE> is a <CONTINOUS FLUID TRANSPORTER> and a <FLUID CONDUCTOR> and a <SYSTEM> that consists of pipe, possibly also including pumps, valves, and control devices, intended for conveying liquids, gases, or finely divided solids"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "[CFIHOS] A fluid conductor that consists of pipe, possibly also including pumps, valves, and control devices, intended for conveying liquids, gases, or finely divided solids."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "[SLB Glossary] A tube or system of tubes used for transporting crude oil and natural gas from the field or gathering system to the refinery."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "[OnePetro] The principle underground transport of produced gas and oil."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> "[POSC Caesar] A fluid conductor that consists of pipe, possibly also including pumps, valves, and control devices, intended for conveying liquids, gases, or finely divided solids."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/EngineeredSystem> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000196> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidTransportFunction>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtSomeTime> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000326> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000092>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> (actuation function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> "actuation function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> "A pneumatic actuator is an actuator that operates using pneumatic power."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> (actuation process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> "actuation process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfAir>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> (pneumatic actuator)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> "pneumatic actuator"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> "A pneumatic actuator is an actuator that operates using pneumatic power."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> "Um atuador pneumático é um atuador que opera usando energia pneumática."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> "Constructive type where pneumatic mechanism is necessary but may not be sufficient under OWA. Specialized pneumatic equipment (pneumatic tools, pneumatic cylinders) might have pneumatic power but should not be classified as actuators without additional validation of their actuation role in control systems."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PNEUMATIC ACTUATOR> is an <INSTRUMENTATION ITEM> and a <CONTROLLED ACTUATOR> that is intended to be operated by pneumatic power"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> "[CFIHOS] An actuator that is intended to be operated by pneumatic power."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> "[POSC Caesar] An actuator that is intended to be operated by pneumatic power."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000207>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000260>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000327> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000298>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticMotorFunction> (pneumatic motor function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticMotorFunction> "pneumatic motor function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticMotorFunction> "A pneumatic motor is a motor that converts compressed gas energy into mechanical rotational energy."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticMotorFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticMotorFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticEnergyConversionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticMotorFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticEnergyConversionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticEnergyConversionProcess> (pneumatic energy conversion process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticEnergyConversionProcess> "pneumatic energy conversion process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticEnergyConversionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticEnergyConversionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticEnergyConversionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328> (pneumatic motor)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328> "pneumatic motor"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328> "A pneumatic motor is a motor that converts compressed gas energy into mechanical rotational energy."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328> "Um motor pneumático é um motor que converte energia de gás comprimido em energia mecânica rotacional."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PNEUMATIC MOTOR> is an <AIR MOTOR> that is driven by compressed gas (typically air)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328> "[CFIHOS] A motor that is driven by compressed gas. Typically air."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328> "[POSC Caesar] A motor that is driven by compressed gas. Typically air."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000315> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PneumaticMotorFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000328> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000113>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingFunction> (interfacing function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingFunction> "interfacing function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingFunction> "A MaterialArtifact that bears an InterfacingFunction and that is capable of providing a point of interface for communication with another object."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingProcess> (interfacing process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingProcess> "interfacing process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InformationContentEntity>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InformationContentEntity>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000329> (port)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000329> "port"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000329> "A MaterialArtifact that bears an InterfacingFunction and that is capable of providing a point of interface for communication with another object."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000329> "Um MaterialArtifact que possui uma InterfacingFunction e que é capaz de fornecer um ponto de interface para comunicação com outro objeto."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000329> "Port ≡ MaterialArtifact ⊓ ∃bearerOf.InterfacingFunction"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000329> "∀x(Port(x) ↔ (MaterialArtifact(x) ∧ ∃f(InterfacingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000329> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PORT> is a <FunctionalObject> that is capable of <PROVIDING> a point of interface for communication with another object"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000329> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InterfacingFunction>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionTransmissionFunction> (position transmission function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionTransmissionFunction> "position transmission function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionTransmissionFunction> "A position transmitter is a transmitter that measures position or displacement and converts it to a standardized output signal."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionTransmissionFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalTransmissionFunction>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalTransmissionFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess> (position measurement and transmission process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess> "position measurement and transmission process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MeasurementProcess>)
Declaration(Class(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MeasurementProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MeasurementProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionMeasurementResult>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionMeasurementAndTransmissionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InformationContentEntity>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> (position transmitter)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> "position transmitter"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> "A position transmitter is a transmitter that measures position or displacement and converts it to a standardized output signal."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> "Um transmissor de posição é um transmissor que mede posição ou deslocamento e o converte em um sinal de saída padronizado."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> "[ISO 15926-4] A <POSITION TRANSMITTER>is a <PROCESS VARIABLE TRANSMITTER> and a <POSITION MEASURING INSTRUMENT>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> "[CFIHOS] A transmitter that is producing a standardized output signal dependent of a received input signal from a position detector."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> "[ISA 5.1] ISA 5.1 tag abbreviation 'ZT'. First letter 'Z': Position, Dimension. Succeeding letters: 'T' = Transmit."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000157> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PositionTransmissionFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000155>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000144>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000118>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000330> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000131>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> (pumping function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "pumping function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "A positive displacement pump is a pump that transports liquid through reciprocating or rotary displacement principle with fixed displacement volume per cycle."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> (pumping process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> "pumping process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfLiquid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfLiquid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> (positive displacement pump)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> "positive displacement pump"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> "A positive displacement pump is a pump that transports liquid through reciprocating or rotary displacement principle with fixed displacement volume per cycle."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> "Uma bomba de deslocamento positivo é uma bomba que transporta líquido através do princípio de deslocamento alternativo ou rotativo com volume de deslocamento fixo por ciclo."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> "Every positive displacement pump is a pump that has a displacement mechanism as component part at all times and participates in positive displacement processes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> "∀x(PositiveDisplacementPump(x) → Pump(x) ∧ ∃y(DisplacementMechanism(y) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,y)) ∧ ∃z(PositiveDisplacementProcess(z) ∧ participatesIn(x,z)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> "Constructive type defined by physical mechanism. Under OWA, sufficient conditions based on displacement mechanism alone could lead to false positives where specialized equipment containing displacement elements might be incorrectly classified as standard positive displacement pumps."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> "[ISO 15926-4] A <POSITIVE DISPLACEMENT PUMP> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <PUMP> intended to transport liquid through the reciprocating or rotary displacement principle and with either fixed or adjustable volume flow rates. NOTE - Combine with either BARE PUMP or PUMP SYSTEM,"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> "[SLB Glossary] A type of fluid pump in which the displacement volume of the pump is fixed for each rotation of the pump."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> (electrical power transformation function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> "electrical power transformation function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> "A TransformerWinding that is part of a power transformer and that serves as the primary winding receiving input electrical power for electromagnetic transformation."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess> (electrical power transformation process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess> "electrical power transformation process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000332> (power transformer primary winding)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000332> "power transformer primary winding"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000332> "A TransformerWinding that is part of a power transformer and that serves as the primary winding receiving input electrical power for electromagnetic transformation."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000332> "Um enrolamento de transformador que é parte de um transformador de potência e que serve como enrolamento primário recebendo energia elétrica de entrada para transformação eletromagnética."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000332> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000332> "Constructive type based on structural position within power transformer. Under OWA, sufficient conditions for primary winding configuration would risk false positives for specialized or hybrid transformer components that contain primary-like windings but should not be classified as standard power transformer primary windings."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000332> "[ISO 15926-4] A <POWER TRANSFORMER PRIMARY WINDING> is a <TRANSFORMER PRIMARY WINDING> intended to be the winding of a power transformer"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000332> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000332> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> (electrical power transformation function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> "electrical power transformation function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> "A FiatObjectPart that is the secondary winding of a power transformer and that bears a SecondaryWindingFunction consisting in delivering transformed electrical power at the output voltage level."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess> (electrical power transformation process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess> "electrical power transformation process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000333> (power transformer secondary winding)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000333> "power transformer secondary winding"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000333> "A FiatObjectPart that is the secondary winding of a power transformer and that bears a SecondaryWindingFunction consisting in delivering transformed electrical power at the output voltage level."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000333> "Uma FiatObjectPart que é o enrolamento secundário de um transformador de potência e que possui uma SecondaryWindingFunction consistindo em fornecer energia elétrica transformada no nível de tensão de saída."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000333> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000333> "Constructive classification basis - the physical configuration (being the secondary winding of a power transformer) provides necessary conditions, but sufficient conditions are harder to assert under OWA without risking false positives for specialized or hybrid transformer configurations."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000333> "[ISO 15926-4] A <POWER TRANSFORMER SECONDARY WINDING> is a <TRANSFORMER SECONDARY WINDING> intended to be the secondary winding of a power transformer"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000333> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000333> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ElectricalPowerTransformationFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionFunction> (pressure indicating and transmission function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionFunction> "pressure indicating and transmission function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionFunction> "A pressure indicating transmitter is a transmitter that measures pressure and provides both local visual indication and electrical signal transmission of the pressure value."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionProcess> (pressure indicating and transmission process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionProcess> "pressure indicating and transmission process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureMeasurementResult>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InformationContentEntity>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureMeasurementResult>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> (pressure indicating transmitter)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> "pressure indicating transmitter"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> "A pressure indicating transmitter is a transmitter that measures pressure and provides both local visual indication and electrical signal transmission of the pressure value."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> "Um transmissor indicador de pressão é um transmissor que mede pressão e fornece tanto indicação visual local quanto transmissão de sinal elétrico do valor da pressão."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> "Every pressure indicating transmitter is a transmitter that bears a pressure indicating and transmission function, has pressure signal as input, and has both electrical signal output and local pressure display."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> "∀x (PressureIndicatingTransmitter(x) ↔ Transmitter(x) ∧ ∃f(PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)) ∧ ∃i(PressureMeasurementResult(i) ∧ hasInput(x,i)) ∧ ∃o1(InformationContentEntity(o1) ∧ hasOutput(x,o1)) ∧ ∃o2(PressureMeasurementResult(o2) ∧ hasOutput(x,o2)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> "[ISA 5.1] ISA 5.1 tag abbreviation 'PIT'. First letter 'P': Pressure. Succeeding letters: 'I' = Indicate, 'T' = Transmit."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000157> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureIndicatingAndTransmissionFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000155>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000118>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000334> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000131>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureFunction> (enclosure function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureFunction> "enclosure function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureFunction> "A casing that surrounds an impeller and has integral suction and discharge nozzles as structural components, typically applied in centrifugal pumps."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureProcess> (enclosure process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureProcess> "enclosure process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> (pump casing)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> "pump casing"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> "A casing that surrounds an impeller and has integral suction and discharge nozzles as structural components, typically applied in centrifugal pumps."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> "Um invólucro que envolve um impulsor e possui bocais de sucção e descarga integrais como componentes estruturais, tipicamente aplicado em bombas centrífugas."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> "Every pump casing is a casing that surrounds an impeller and has integral suction and discharge nozzles forming part of its structure."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> "∀x(PumpCasing(x) → Casing(x) ∧ ∃y(Impeller(y) ∧ surrounds(x,y)) ∧ ∃z(SuctionNozzle(z) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,z)) ∧ ∃w(DischargeNozzle(w) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,w)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> "Constructive type based on physical configuration. Under Open World Assumption, structural characteristics are harder to make sufficient - any assembly with an impeller and integral nozzles might be classified as a pump casing even if it serves a different specialized purpose. Starting with necessary conditions protects against false positives."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PUMP CASING> is a  <CASING> and a single wall surrounding the impeller. The suction and discharge nozzles form an integral part of the casing. Typically applied for centrifugal pumps"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000222>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000335> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/EnclosureFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> (power transmission function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> "power transmission function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> "A pump shaft is a MaterialArtifact that bears a PowerTransmissionFunction and that is equipped with impeller(s), bearings, bushings, and sealing elements as part of a pump assembly for transmitting rotational mechanical energy to enable fluid pumping operations."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> (power transmission process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> "power transmission process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000336> (pump shaft)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000336> "pump shaft"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000336> "A pump shaft is a MaterialArtifact that bears a PowerTransmissionFunction and that is equipped with impeller(s), bearings, bushings, and sealing elements as part of a pump assembly for transmitting rotational mechanical energy to enable fluid pumping operations."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000336> "Um eixo de bomba é um MaterialArtifact que possui uma PowerTransmissionFunction e que é equipado com impulsor(es), mancais, buchas e elementos de vedação como parte de um conjunto de bomba para transmitir energia mecânica rotacional e possibilitar operações de bombeamento de fluidos."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000336> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000336> "As a constructive type defined by physical configuration, sufficient conditions are omitted to avoid false positives under OWA. Any rotating component with an impeller and bearings could theoretically be classified as a pump shaft under sufficient conditions, including hybrid equipment or specialized assemblies that should not be automatically categorized as standard pump shafts."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000336> "[ISO 15926-4] A <PUMP SHAFT> is a <SHAFT> of a pump that is provided with impeller(s), bearings, bushings, sealing elements etc."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000336> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000336> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> (pumping function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "pumping function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "A reciprocating pump is a pump that contains pistons or plungers designed to move in a reciprocating motion within cylindrical chambers to displace fluid through positive displacement action."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> (pumping process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> "pumping process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> (reciprocating pump)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "reciprocating pump"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "A reciprocating pump is a pump that contains pistons or plungers designed to move in a reciprocating motion within cylindrical chambers to displace fluid through positive displacement action."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "Uma bomba alternativa é uma bomba que contém pistões ou êmbolos projetados para se moverem em movimento alternativo dentro de câmaras cilíndricas para deslocar fluido através de ação de deslocamento positivo."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "Every reciprocating pump is a pump that has as component part at all times a reciprocating displacement mechanism and has as component part at all times pistons or plungers and has as component part at all times cylindrical chambers."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "∀x(ReciprocatingPump(x) → Pump(x) ∧ ∃m(ReciprocatingDisplacementMechanism(m) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,m)) ∧ ∃p(PistonOrPlunger(p) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,p)) ∧ ∃c(CylindricalChamber(c) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,c)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "Using necessary conditions for this constructive type. Under Open World Assumption, asserting equivalence based on structural differentia could lead to false positives where complex equipment containing reciprocating elements (like reciprocating compressors with auxiliary pumps, or hybrid systems) might be incorrectly classified as standard reciprocating pumps. The structural mechanism is necessary but sufficient conditions require domain expert validation."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "[ISO 15926-4] A <RECIPROCATING PUMP> is a <POSITIVE DISPLACEMENT PUMP> which contains a displacing element intended to be moved in a reciprocating movement to exert pressure on a fluid, typically moving within a cylindrical space."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "[CFIHOS] A positive displacement pump which contains a displacing element intended to be moved in a reciprocating movement to exert pressure on a fluid, typically moving within a cylindrical space."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "[SLB Glossary] A type of fluid pump in which reciprocating pistons or plungers displace the fluid."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "[OnePetro] A piston pump."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> "[POSC Caesar] a positive displacement pump which contains a displacing element intended to be moved in a reciprocating movement to exert pressure on a fluid, typically moving within a cylindrical space."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000102>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000289>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayFunction> (signal relay function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayFunction> "signal relay function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayFunction> "A relay is an electrical switching device that bears a signal relay function, realized by passing on information or signals from one circuit to control operations in another circuit."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayProcess> (signal relay process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayProcess> "signal relay process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InformationContentEntity>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/InformationContentEntity>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> (relay)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> "relay"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> "A relay is an electrical switching device that bears a signal relay function, realized by passing on information or signals from one circuit to control operations in another circuit."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> "Um relé é um dispositivo de comutação elétrica que possui uma função de relé de sinal, realizada ao transmitir informações ou sinais de um circuito para controlar operações em outro circuito."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> "Every Relay is an ElectricalSwitchingDevice that bearerOf some SignalRelayFunction"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> "∀x(Relay(x) ↔ (ElectricalSwitchingDevice(x) ∧ ∃f(SignalRelayFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> "[ISO 15926-4] A <RELAY> is a <SWITCHING DEVICE> that usually is incorporating an electromagnet, whereby a current or signal in one circuit can open or close another circuit"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that can be any electrical device, usually incorporating an electromagnet, whereby a current or signal in one circuit can open or close another circuit."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> "[ISA 5.1] a device, whose function is to pass on information in an unchanged form or in some modified form, often used to mean the preferred term computing device."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SignalRelayFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000086>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000338> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000315>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> (fluid conduction function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "fluid conduction function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> "A riser is a pipe that has vertical or near-vertical orientation and is designed for the upward flow of liquid or gas."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> (fluid conduction process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> "fluid conduction process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> (riser)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "riser"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "A riser is a pipe that has vertical or near-vertical orientation and is designed for the upward flow of liquid or gas."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "Um riser é um tubo que tem orientação vertical ou quase vertical e é projetado para o fluxo ascendente de líquido ou gás."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "Every riser is a pipe that has vertical orientation and participates in upward flow processes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "∀x (Riser(x) → Pipe(x) ∧ ∃q(VerticalOrientation(q) ∧ hasQuality(x,q)) ∧ ∃p(UpwardFlowProcess(p) ∧ participatesIn(x,p)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "Using necessary conditions because this is a constructive type defined by physical configuration. Under OWA, any pipe with vertical orientation and upward flow could be forced into this category, including specialized equipment that should not be classified as standard risers (e.g., reactor internals, distillation column internals). Starting with necessary conditions protects against false positives."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "[ISO 15926-4] A <RISER> is a <FLUID CONDUCTOR> and a <FLUID TRANSPORTER> that is a vertical or near vertical pipe for the upward flow of liquid or gas"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is a vertical or near vertical pipe for the upward flow of liquid or gas."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "[OnePetro] Pipe through which liquid travels upward."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> "[POSC Caesar] A physical object that is a vertical or near vertical pipe for the upward flow of liquid or gas."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000321>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000339> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/FluidConductionFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> (actuation function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> "actuation function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> "A rotary actuator is an actuator that causes rotary motion by converting control signals into controlled rotational mechanical output."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> (actuation process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> "actuation process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ControlSignal>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000340> (rotary actuator)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000340> "rotary actuator"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000340> "A rotary actuator is an actuator that causes rotary motion by converting control signals into controlled rotational mechanical output."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000340> "Um atuador rotativo é um atuador que causa movimento rotativo convertendo sinais de controle em saída mecânica rotacional controlada."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000340> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000340> "Constructive type based on rotary motion mechanism. Under OWA, providing sufficient conditions could lead to over-classification where any equipment that happens to produce rotary motion (motors, turbines, etc.) might be incorrectly classified as rotary actuators. The rotary motion differentia is necessary but requires domain expert validation to confirm it is sufficient for the actuator equipment category."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000340> "[ISO 15926-4] A <ROTARY ACTUATOR> is an <ARTEFACT> and an <ACTUATOR> causing a rotary motion"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000340> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000207>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000340> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ActuationFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> (pumping function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "pumping function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> "A rotary pump is a positive displacement pump that contains a chamber with gears, cams, screws, vanes, plungers or similar elements actuated by relative rotation of the drive shaft or casing, and which has no separate inlet and outlet valves."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> (pumping process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> "pumping process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> (rotary pump)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "rotary pump"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "A rotary pump is a positive displacement pump that contains a chamber with gears, cams, screws, vanes, plungers or similar elements actuated by relative rotation of the drive shaft or casing, and which has no separate inlet and outlet valves."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "Uma bomba rotativa é uma bomba de deslocamento positivo que contém uma câmara com engrenagens, cames, parafusos, palhetas, êmbolos ou elementos similares acionados pela rotação relativa do eixo de acionamento ou carcaça, e que não possui válvulas separadas de entrada e saída."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "Every rotary pump is a positive displacement pump that has a rotary displacement mechanism as component part and lacks separate inlet and outlet valves."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "∀x (RotaryPump(x) → PositiveDisplacementPump(x) ∧ ∃y (RotaryDisplacementMechanism(y) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,y)) ∧ ¬∃z (SeparateInletValve(z) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,z)) ∧ ¬∃w (SeparateOutletValve(w) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,w)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "Using necessary conditions for this constructive type. While the rotary mechanism is clearly necessary for rotary pumps, making it sufficient under OWA could lead to false positives where complex equipment containing rotary elements (like gearboxes with pumping side-effects or hybrid machines) might be misclassified as standard rotary pumps. The constructive differentia should be validated by domain experts before upgrading to equivalence."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "[ISO 15926-4] A <ROTARY PUMP> is a <POSITIVE DISPLACEMENT PUMP> that consists of a chamber containing gears, cams, screws, vanes, plungers or similar elements actuated by relative rotation of the drive shaft or casing and which has no separate inlet and outlet valves."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "[CFIHOS] A positive displacement pump that consists of a chamber containing gears, cams, screws, vanes, plungers or similar elements actuated by relative rotation of the drive shaft or casing and which has no separate inlet and outlet valves."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> "[POSC Caesar] A positive displacement pump that consists of a chamber containing gears, cams, screws, vanes, plungers or similar elements actuated by relative rotation of the drive shaft or casing and which has no separate inlet and outlet valves."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000331>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpingFunction>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000257>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpChamber>))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpChamber> "pump chamber"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PumpChamber> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000341> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000337>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferFunction> (rotational energy transfer function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferFunction> "rotational energy transfer function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferFunction> "An Assembly that participates in rotational motion and has a rotor shaft as an essential component, designed to transfer mechanical energy through rotational motion within a machine assembly."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferProcess> (rotational energy transfer process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferProcess> "rotational energy transfer process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> (rotor)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> "rotor"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> "An Assembly that participates in rotational motion and has a rotor shaft as an essential component, designed to transfer mechanical energy through rotational motion within a machine assembly."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> "Um Assembly que participa em movimento rotacional e tem um eixo do rotor como componente essencial, projetado para transferir energia mecânica através de movimento rotacional dentro de um conjunto de máquina."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> "As a constructive type defined by physical configuration (rotating portion with shaft), providing sufficient conditions under OWA could lead to overclassification. Complex assemblies containing rotating elements might be incorrectly classified as rotors rather than their proper categories (motors, compressors, etc.)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> "[ISO 15926-4] A <ROTOR> is a <MACHINE COMPONENT> that is the rotating portion of a machine"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> "[OnePetro] The rotating shaft in a PDM motor."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000342> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RotationalEnergyTransferFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefFunction> (pressure relief function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefFunction> "pressure relief function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefFunction> "A rupture disc is an instrument that realizes pressure relief through irreversible rupture at a calibrated pressure."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefProcess> (pressure relief process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefProcess> "pressure relief process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> (rupture disc)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> "rupture disc"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> "A rupture disc is an instrument that realizes pressure relief through irreversible rupture at a calibrated pressure."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> "Um disco de ruptura é um instrumento que realiza alívio de pressão através de ruptura irreversível em uma pressão calibrada."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> "Every rupture disc is an instrument that has the function to relieve pressure and participates in irreversible rupture processes at calibrated pressure thresholds."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> "∀x (RuptureDisc(x) ↔ Instrument(x) ∧ ∃f(PressureReliefFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)) ∧ ∃p(IrreversibleRuptureProcess(p) ∧ participatesIn(x,p)) ∧ ∃q(CalibrationPressure(q) ∧ hasQuality(x,q)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> "[ISO 15926-4] A <RUPTURE DISC> is an <INSTRUMENT COMPONENT> and an <OVERPRESSURE PROTECTOR> that is designed to burst at a certain excess pressure. It is a part of <RUPTURE DISC ASSEMBLY>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is a pressure relieving device designed to burst at a calibrated pressure to prevent pressure in systems or vessels from reaching unsafe levels."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> "[POSC Caesar] A physical object that is designed to burst at a certain excess pressure. It is part of a rupture disc assembly."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000091> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PressureReliefFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000103>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000087>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000343> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000143>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingFunction> (scraping function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingFunction> "scraping function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingFunction> "A scraper is a material artifact that bears a scraping function for mechanically removing deposits, debris, or contaminants from surfaces."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingProcess> (scraping process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingProcess> "scraping process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/Surface>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/Surface>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RemovedMaterial>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> (scraper)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> "scraper"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> "A scraper is a material artifact that bears a scraping function for mechanically removing deposits, debris, or contaminants from surfaces."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> "Um raspador é um artefato material que possui uma função de raspagem para remover mecanicamente depósitos, detritos ou contaminantes de superfícies."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> "Every scraper is a material artifact that has a scraping function, and every material artifact that has a scraping function is a scraper."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> "∀x(Scraper(x) ↔ (MaterialArtifact(x) ∧ ∃f(ScrapingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> "[ISO 15926-4] A <SCRAPER> is a <FunctionalObject> that is capable of <SCRAPING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> "[CFIHOS] A physical object intended to mechanically remove a deposit from a surface."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> "[SLB Glossary] Also called a pig, a device with blades or brushes inserted in a pipeline for cleaning purposes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> "[OnePetro] A device that cuts through paraffin, asphaltenes, etc. inside the pipe. Run on wireline."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ScrapingFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000081>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000344> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationFunction> (separation function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationFunction> "separation function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationFunction> "A scrubber is a separator that cleans gas by washing the gas flow with liquid to remove contaminants such as dust, particles, or undesired substances."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationProcess> (separation process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationProcess> "separation process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfLiquid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfGas>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfLiquid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> (scrubber)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "scrubber"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "A scrubber is a separator that cleans gas by washing the gas flow with liquid to remove contaminants such as dust, particles, or undesired substances."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "Um lavador de gases é um separador que limpa gás através da lavagem do fluxo gasoso com líquido para remover contaminantes como poeira, partículas ou substâncias indesejadas."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "Every scrubber is a separator that has the function of separation and participates in liquid washing processes with both gas and liquid inputs."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "∀x (Scrubber(x) ↔ Separator(x) ∧ ∃f,p,g,l (SeparationFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f) ∧ LiquidWashingProcess(p) ∧ participatesIn(x,p) ∧ PortionOfGas(g) ∧ PortionOfLiquid(l) ∧ hasInput(x,g) ∧ hasInput(x,l)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "[ISO 15926-4] A <SCRUBBER> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <SEPARATOR> intended to clean gas by washing the gas flow with water or with another liquid entering at the top of the vessel and sprayed in the gas. Typically to remove dust and small particles"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "[CFIHOS] A distillation column intended to clean gas by washing the gas flow with water or with another liquid entering at the top of the vessel and sprayed in the gas. Typically to remove dust and small particles."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "[SLB Glossary] A device to remove dirt, water, foreign matter, or undesired liquids that are part of the gas flowstream."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "[OnePetro] A reactor that removes various components from produced gas."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> "[POSC Caesar] A distillation column intended to clean gas by washing the gas flow with water or with another liquid entering at the top of the vessel and sprayed in the gas. Typically to remove dust and small particles."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000084>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SeparationFunction>))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000073>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000072>)
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000345> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000092>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> (power transmission function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> "power transmission function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> "An Assembly that bears a PowerTransmissionFunction and that has component parts including shaft keys for torque transmission and shaft seals for leakage prevention, serving as the core rotating element in rotating machinery."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> (power transmission process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> "power transmission process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346> (shaft)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346> "shaft"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346> "An Assembly that bears a PowerTransmissionFunction and that has component parts including shaft keys for torque transmission and shaft seals for leakage prevention, serving as the core rotating element in rotating machinery."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346> "Um Assembly que porta uma PowerTransmissionFunction e que possui partes componentes incluindo chavetas de eixo para transmissão de torque e vedações de eixo para prevenção de vazamento, servindo como o elemento rotativo central em máquinas rotativas."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346> "Constructive classification based on physical structure. Under OWA, sufficient conditions for shaft identity could lead to false positives - any assembly with a shaft key and rotational motion might be classified as a shaft rather than a more specific equipment type that contains a shaft. The structural differentia provides necessary conditions while allowing domain experts to validate sufficiency."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346> "[ISO 15926-4] A <SHAFT> is an <ENGINE COMPONENT> that is the core rotating element on which the rotating parts are mounted and through which energy is either transmitted from the prime mover or generated in case of a driver."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000346> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingFunction> (shaking function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingFunction> "shaking function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingFunction> "A shaker is an assembly that bears a shaking function, capable of producing vibrating or oscillating motion for material processing, agitation, or separation."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingProcess> (shaking process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingProcess> "shaking process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MaterialEntity>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MaterialEntity>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> (shaker)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> "shaker"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> "A shaker is an assembly that bears a shaking function, capable of producing vibrating or oscillating motion for material processing, agitation, or separation."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> "Um agitador é um conjunto que possui uma função de agitação, capaz de produzir movimento vibratório ou oscilatório para processamento, agitação ou separação de materiais."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> "Every shaker is an assembly that has the capability of shaking and contains a vibration mechanism and a shaking element."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> "Shaker(x) ↔ Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f(ShakingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> "[ISO 15926-4] A <SHAKER> is a <FunctionalObject> that has the capability of <SHAKING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> "[SLB Glossary] Abbreviation for shale shaker, the primary and probably most important device on the rig for removing drilled solids from the mud."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> "[OnePetro] A piece of drilling equipment, usually with a vibrating screen, where drill cuttings are removed from the flowing mud."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShakingFunction>)))
DisjointClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000347> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000225>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingFunction> (pipe shearing function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingFunction> "pipe shearing function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingFunction> "A shear ram is a ram that bears a pipe shearing function and has hardened cutting blades designed to cut drillpipe or tubing during blowout prevention operations."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingProcess> (pipe shearing process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingProcess> "pipe shearing process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SteelPipe>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SteelPipe>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> (shear ram)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> "shear ram"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> "A shear ram is a ram that bears a pipe shearing function and has hardened cutting blades designed to cut drillpipe or tubing during blowout prevention operations."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> "Um aríete de corte é um aríete que possui função de corte de tubulação e tem lâminas de corte endurecidas projetadas para cortar a coluna de perfuração ou tubulação durante operações de prevenção de blowout."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> "Every shear ram is a ram that has the function to shear pipe and has shearing blades as component parts at all times."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> "∀x(ShearRam(x) ↔ Ram(x) ∧ ∃f(PipeShearingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)) ∧ ∃b(ShearingBlade(b) ∧ hasComponentPartAtAllTimes(x,b)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> "[ISO 15926-4] A <SHEAR RAM> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <RAM> that is a closure mechanism on a wells blowout-preventer stack fitted with chisel-like jaws that are hydraulically operated. When the ram is closed on the pipe, the jaws or blades cut the pipe, permitting the upper section to be removed from the BOP stack"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> "[CFIHOS] A shear valve is a ram-type BOP, similar in operation to a gate valve, but uses a pair of opposing steel plungers, rams. The rams extend toward the centre of the wellbore to restrict flow or retract open in order to permit flow."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> "[SLB Glossary] A blowout preventer (BOP) closing element fitted with hardened tool steel blades designed to cut the drillpipe or tubing when the BOP is closed, and then fully close to provide isolation or sealing of the wellbore."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> "[OnePetro] A ram in the BOP that shears off the pipe."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000348> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PipeShearingFunction>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasComponentPartAtAllTimes> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShearingBlade>)))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShearingBlade> "shearing blade"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ShearingBlade> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> (power transmission function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> "power transmission function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> "A sheave is a material artifact that is a grooved wheel designed to transmit mechanical power through interface with belts, ropes, wires, or pipes."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> (power transmission process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> "power transmission process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> (sheave)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> "sheave"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> "A sheave is a material artifact that is a grooved wheel designed to transmit mechanical power through interface with belts, ropes, wires, or pipes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> "Uma polia é um artefato material que é uma roda sulcada projetada para transmitir energia mecânica através da interface com correias, cordas, cabos ou tubos."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> "Constructive type based on physical structure. Under OWA, defining sufficient conditions based solely on having a grooved rim could lead to false positives where other grooved mechanical elements (like timing belt pulleys with different design intents) are automatically classified as sheaves. The structural differentia provides necessary conditions while allowing domain experts to confirm sufficient conditions."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> "[ISO 15926-4] A <SHEAVE> is an <ARTEFACT> and a <WHEEL> which is grooved for use with vee-belts, ropes, round belts, wire or pipe"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> "[CFIHOS] A wheel which is grooved for use with vee-belts, ropes, round belts, wire or pipe."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> "[SLB Glossary] In oilfield usage, the term usually refers to either the pulleys permanently mounted on the top of the rig (the crown blocks), or the pulleys used for running wireline tools into the wellbore."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> "[OnePetro] A grooved pulley."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000349> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PowerTransmissionFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingFunction> (noise silencing function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingFunction> "noise silencing function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingFunction> "A silencer is an assembly that bears the designed function of reducing noise levels through acoustic treatment of fluid streams."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingProcess> (noise silencing process)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingProcess> "noise silencing process"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000350> (silencer)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000350> "silencer"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000350> "A silencer is an assembly that bears the designed function of reducing noise levels through acoustic treatment of fluid streams."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000350> "Um silenciador é uma montagem que possui a função projetada de reduzir níveis de ruído através do tratamento acústico de fluxos de fluidos."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000350> "Every silencer is an assembly that has the function to silence noise, and every assembly that has the function to silence noise is a silencer."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/firstOrderLogicAxiom> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000350> "∀x(Silencer(x) ↔ Assembly(x) ∧ ∃f(NoiseSilencingFunction(f) ∧ bearerOf(x,f)))"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000350> "[ISO 15926-4] A <SILENCER> is a <FunctionalObject> that has a capability of <SILENCING>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000350> "[CFIHOS] A physical object intended to reduce a noise level."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000350> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/Assembly> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/NoiseSilencingFunction>)))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SolidBulkStorageFunction> (solid bulk storage function)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SolidBulkStorageFunction> "solid bulk storage function"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SolidBulkStorageFunction> "A silo is a vessel that bears a solid bulk storage function and has a conical bottom section for facilitating the storage and discharge of bulk solid materials."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SolidBulkStorageFunction> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/DesignedFunction>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SolidBulkStorageFunction> ObjectAllValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SolidBulkStorageProcess>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SolidBulkStorageFunction> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000054> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SolidBulkStorageProcess>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/SolidBulkStorageProcess> (solid bulk storage process)

