SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PropertyMeasurementProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PropertyMeasurementProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PropertyMeasurementProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/MeasurementInformationContentEntity>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000573> (measuring element)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000573> "measuring element"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000573> "A material artifact that bears a property measurement function, used for the measurement of a property and defined independently from the measuring instrument that handles that measurement result."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000573> "Um artefato material que possui uma função de medição de propriedade, usado para a medição de uma propriedade e definido independentemente do instrumento de medição que trata esse resultado."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000573> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000573> "Same-genus same-function (CLAUDE.md): the element's identity-giving function is the sensing captured by InstrumentationFunction, which its genus Instrument already bears, so equivalence would collapse the two. What distinguishes the element is stated by ISO 15926 relationally — it is \"defined independently from a MEASURING INSTRUMENT that is handling that measurement result\" — and a relational condition is not sufficient under OWA."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000573> "[ISO 15926-4] A <MEASURING ELEMENT> is a <PROCESS SIGNAL GENERATING FUNCTION> used for the measurement of a <Property>. It is defined independently from a <MEASURING INSTRUMENT> that is handling that measurement result and that may or may not house that <MEASURING ELEMENT>; If so, there is an assembly relationship, if not, there is a connection relationship"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000573> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000091>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000573> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PropertyMeasurementFunction>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction> (containment function)

