SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasInput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/PortionOfFluid>))

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> (chamber)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> "chamber"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> "A material artifact that is an enclosed space within a larger artifact, bearing a containment function."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> "Um artefato material que é um espaço fechado dentro de um artefato maior, possuindo uma função de contenção."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> "ContainmentFunction is shared with every containing artifact in COPI, so it cannot be sufficient. Interiority is a relational condition, not a sufficient one."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> "[ISO 15926-4] A <CHAMBER> is an <ARTEFACT> and an <ENCLOSURE>, especially one inside an <ARTEFACT>"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> "[CFIHOS] A physical object that is an enclosed space."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000722> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/ContainmentFunction>))

