SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RockCuttingProcess> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasSpecifiedOutput> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RockCuttings>))

