AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000723> "A material artifact that bears a rock cutting function, used to crush or cut formation rock in order to create a borehole."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000723> "Um artefato material que possui uma função de corte de rocha, usado para triturar ou cortar rocha da formação a fim de criar um poço."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000723> "[ISO 15926-4] A <DRILL BIT> is a <CUTTING TOOL> used to create cylindrical holes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000723> "[SLB Glossary] The tool used to crush or cut rock."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000723> "[OnePetro] The rock cutting device at the bottom of the drill string."@en)
EquivalentClasses(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000723> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/RockCuttingFunction>)))

