SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TubingHangerSeatingProcess> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/PlannedProcess>)

# Class: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000733> (tubing bowl)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000733> "tubing bowl"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000733> "A material artifact that is the section of a tubing head which accommodates the tubing hanger, where it sets and seals."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000733> "Um artefato material que é a seção de uma cabeça de produção que acomoda o suspensor da coluna, onde este assenta e veda."@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/isPrimitive> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000733> "true"^^xsd:boolean)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/primitiveRationale> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000733> "Definition locates it within the wellhead rather than characterising it independently; parthood is not a sufficient condition."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(skos:definition <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000733> "[OnePetro] A section in a part of the wellhead that accommodates the tubing hanger."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000733> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
SubClassOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/COPI_0000733> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/hasFunction> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/copi/TubingHangerSeatingFunction>))

